var englishSSWFisheryAquacultureSystemsCatalog = map[examSSWEnglishKey]string{
	{field: "ssw.group", source: `Budi daya · Sarana, kerang, dan rumput laut`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                                         `Aquaculture · Facilities, Shellfish, and Seaweed`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Mengapa organisme penempel pada jaring dipantau?`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                                   `Why are organisms attached to nets monitored?`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Kasus: Robekan jaring terdeteksi saat cuaca memburuk. Tindakan yang paling tepat adalah…`}:                                                                                                                                                                           `Scenario: A tear in a net is detected as the weather worsens. The most appropriate action is to…`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Dalam konteks lesson ini, apa arti 付着生物（ふちゃくせいぶつ）?`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                                 `In this lesson, what does 付着生物（ふちゃくせいぶつ） mean?`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Pada alur kerja «Keramba, jaring, dan pengendalian organisme penempel» dalam materi, langkah pertama sebelum tahap berikutnya adalah…`}:                                                                                                                              `In the workflow “Fish cages, nets, and control of attached organisms” in the material, the first step before proceeding is to…`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Cangkang normal membuktikan kerang aman saat area ditutup?`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                         `Does a normal-looking shell prove shellfish are safe when the area is closed?`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Kasus: Ada pemberitahuan resmi penutupan panen pada area kerang. Tindakan yang paling tepat adalah…`}:                                                                                                                                                                `Scenario: An official notice closes the shellfish harvesting area. The most appropriate action is to…`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Dalam konteks lesson ini, apa arti 採苗（さいびょう）?`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                                      `In this lesson, what does 採苗（さいびょう） mean?`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Pada alur kerja «Kerang, pakan alami, dan area panen» dalam materi, langkah pertama sebelum tahap berikutnya adalah…`}:                                                                                                                                               `In the workflow “Shellfish, natural feed, and harvesting areas” in the material, the first step before proceeding is to…`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Apa kebutuhan penting rumput laut selain sarana?`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                                   `Besides facilities, what does seaweed need?`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Kasus: Rumput laut berubah warna dan penempel meningkat pada unit padat. Tindakan yang paling tepat adalah…`}:                                                                                                                                                        `Scenario: Seaweed changes color and attached growth increases on a crowded unit. The most appropriate action is to…`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Dalam konteks lesson ini, apa arti 収穫（しゅうかく）?`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                                      `In this lesson, what does 収穫（しゅうかく） mean?`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Pada alur kerja «Rumput laut, cahaya, dan pemeliharaan tali» dalam materi, langkah pertama sebelum tahap berikutnya adalah…`}:                                                                                                                                        `In the workflow “Seaweed, light, and line maintenance” in the material, the first step before proceeding is to…`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Perawatan jaring mendukung aliran air dan integritas sarana.`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                  `Net maintenance supports water flow and facility integrity.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Laporkan dan ikuti rencana pengamanan tanpa masuk air spontan. Perawatan jaring mendukung aliran air dan integritas sarana.`}:                                                                                                                                   `Report the issue and follow the safety plan; do not enter the water spontaneously. Net maintenance supports water flow and facility integrity.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `付着生物 dibaca ふちゃくせいぶつ dan berarti organisme penempel. Kenali istilah ini sebelum mengikuti instruksi kerja.`}:                                                                                                                                                    `付着生物 is read ふちゃくせいぶつ and means attached organisms. Learn this term before following work instructions.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Mulai dengan periksa jaring pengikat dan akses aman. Setelah itu: Catat robekan serta penempel → Koordinasikan perawatan sesuai SOP → Periksa unit dan jumlah setelah tindakan. Urutan ini berlaku pada kasus dan prosedur yang dijelaskan di lesson.`}:         `Start by checking net fastenings and safe access. Then: Record tears and attached growth → Coordinate maintenance according to the SOP → Inspect the unit and count after the work. This sequence applies to the scenarios and procedures explained in the lesson.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Bahaya lingkungan atau biotoksin tidak dinilai hanya dari penampilan.`}:                                                                                                                                                                                         `Environmental hazards or biotoxins cannot be assessed by appearance alone.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Hentikan panen sesuai ketentuan dan konfirmasikan status. Bahaya lingkungan atau biotoksin tidak dinilai hanya dari penampilan.`}:                                                                                                                               `Stop harvesting as required and confirm the status. Environmental hazards or biotoxins cannot be assessed by appearance alone.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `採苗 dibaca さいびょう dan berarti pengumpulan benih. Kenali istilah ini sebelum mengikuti instruksi kerja.`}:                                                                                                                                                          `採苗 is read さいびょう and means seed collection. Learn this term before following work instructions.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Mulai dengan periksa status area serta lot kerang. Setelah itu: Amati sarana dan kondisi pertumbuhan → Panen hanya sesuai izin serta rencana → Catat asal waktu dan penanganan. Urutan ini berlaku pada kasus dan prosedur yang dijelaskan di lesson.`}:         `Start by checking the area status and shellfish lot. Then: Observe the facilities and growth conditions → Harvest only as permitted and planned → Record origin, time, and handling. This sequence applies to the scenarios and procedures explained in the lesson.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Fotosintesis dan pertumbuhan bergantung lingkungan; kebutuhan spesifik mengikuti komoditas.`}:                                                                                                                                                                   `Photosynthesis and growth depend on the environment; specific needs vary by crop.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Catat dan laporkan kondisi untuk penilaian lingkungan serta pemeliharaan. Fotosintesis dan pertumbuhan bergantung lingkungan; kebutuhan spesifik mengikuti komoditas.`}:                                                                                         `Record and report the conditions for environmental assessment and maintenance. Photosynthesis and growth depend on the environment; specific needs vary by crop.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `収穫 dibaca しゅうかく dan berarti panen. Kenali istilah ini sebelum mengikuti instruksi kerja.`}:                                                                                                                                                                      `収穫 is read しゅうかく and means harvest. Learn this term before following work instructions.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Mulai dengan periksa spesies fase dan sarana tali. Setelah itu: Amati kondisi lingkungan serta kepadatan → Rawat sesuai rencana komoditas → Catat pertumbuhan serta perubahan jaringan. Urutan ini berlaku pada kasus dan prosedur yang dijelaskan di lesson.`}: `Start by checking the species, growth stage, and lines. Then: Observe environmental conditions and density → Maintain the crop according to its plan → Record growth and changes in the thalli. This sequence applies to the scenarios and procedures explained in the lesson.`,
	{field: "ssw.passage", source: `Robekan jaring terdeteksi saat cuaca memburuk.`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                                    `A tear in a net is detected as the weather worsens.`,
	{field: "ssw.passage", source: `Ada pemberitahuan resmi penutupan panen pada area kerang.`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                         `An official notice closes the shellfish harvesting area.`,
	{field: "ssw.passage", source: `Rumput laut berubah warna dan penempel meningkat pada unit padat.`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                 `Seaweed changes color and attached growth increases on a crowded unit.`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Selalu menjadi pakan cukup`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         `Always provide enough feed`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Menggantikan jaring`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                `Replace the net`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Menjamin ikan tidak sakit`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          `Guarantee that fish do not become ill`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Dapat mengurangi pertukaran air dan menambah beban`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                                 `Can reduce water exchange and increase the load`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Tambahkan bahan kimia acak`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         `Add chemicals at random`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Laporkan dan ikuti rencana pengamanan tanpa masuk air spontan`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                      `Report the issue and follow the safety plan; do not enter the water spontaneously`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Terjun memperbaiki sendiri`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         `Dive in and repair it yourself`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Abaikan sampai panen`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               `Ignore it until harvest`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `organisme penempel`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 `attached organisms`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `kerusakan`}:                                                                `damage`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `penggantian`}:                                                              `replacement`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `jaring`}:                                                                   `net`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Periksa unit dan jumlah setelah tindakan`}:                                 `Inspect the unit and count after the work`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Periksa status area serta lot kerang`}:                                     `Check the area status and shellfish lot`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Periksa jaring pengikat dan akses aman`}:                                   `Check net fastenings and safe access`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Catat robekan serta penempel`}:                                             `Record tears and attached growth`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Koordinasikan perawatan sesuai SOP`}:                                       `Coordinate maintenance according to the SOP`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Ya setelah dibilas`}:                                                       `Yes, after rinsing`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Ya jika pembeli setuju`}:                                                   `Yes, if the buyer agrees`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Tidak status area dan ketentuan panen harus dipatuhi`}:                     `No; the area status and harvest requirements must be followed`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Ya selalu`}:                                                                `Yes, always`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Hentikan panen sesuai ketentuan dan konfirmasikan status`}:                 `Stop harvesting as required and confirm the status`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Panen lalu cuci agar aman`}:                                                `Harvest it and wash it to make it safe`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Campur dari area lain tanpa label`}:                                        `Mix it with shellfish from another area without a label`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Ganti tanggal asal`}:                                                       `Change the origin date`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `pengumpulan benih`}:                                                        `seed collection`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `area perairan`}:                                                            `water area`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `kerang`}:                                                                   `shellfish`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `penyaringan`}:                                                              `filtering`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Amati sarana dan kondisi pertumbuhan`}:                                     `Observe the facilities and growth conditions`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Panen hanya sesuai izin serta rencana`}:                                    `Harvest only as permitted and planned`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Catat asal waktu dan penanganan`}:                                          `Record origin, time, and handling`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Air tanpa pertukaran selamanya`}:                                           `Water with no exchange ever`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Cahaya dan kondisi air sesuai spesies`}:                                    `Light and water conditions suited to the species`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Pakan ikan untuk semua jenis`}:                                             `Fish feed for every species`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Tidak memerlukan pemantauan`}:                                              `No monitoring is needed`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Semprot obat tanpa izin`}:                                                  `Spray medication without authorization`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Tambahkan pakan ikan`}:                                                     `Add fish feed`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Abaikan karena tanpa pakan`}:                                               `Ignore it because seaweed is not fed`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Catat dan laporkan kondisi untuk penilaian lingkungan serta pemeliharaan`}: `Record and report the conditions for environmental assessment and maintenance`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `panen`}:                                                                    `harvest`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `rumput laut`}:                                                              `seaweed`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `cahaya`}:                                                                   `light`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `pemeliharaan pembesaran`}:                                                  `grow-out maintenance`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Amati kondisi lingkungan serta kepadatan`}:                                 `Observe environmental conditions and density`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Rawat sesuai rencana komoditas`}:                                           `Maintain the crop according to its plan`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Catat pertumbuhan serta perubahan jaringan`}:                               `Record growth and changes in the thalli`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Periksa spesies fase dan sarana tali`}:                                     `Check the species, growth stage, and lines`,
}

var englishSSWFisheryAquacultureProductsCatalog = map[examSSWEnglishKey]string{
	{field: "ssw.group", source: `Budi daya · Panen, laporan, dan integrasi`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  `Aquaculture · Harvest, Records, and Integration`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Penampilan sehat menggantikan pemeriksaan status perlakuan sebelum panen?`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                 `Does a healthy appearance replace checking treatment status before harvest?`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Kasus: Catatan perlakuan kelompok belum lengkap menjelang panen. Tindakan yang paling tepat adalah…`}:                                                                                                                                                                       `Scenario: Treatment records for a group are incomplete as harvest approaches. The most appropriate action is to…`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Dalam konteks lesson ini, apa arti 出荷（しゅっか）?`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                                              `In this lesson, what does 出荷（しゅっか） mean?`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Pada alur kerja «Persiapan panen dan status perlakuan» dalam materi, langkah pertama sebelum tahap berikutnya adalah…`}:                                                                                                                                                     `In the workflow “Harvest preparation and treatment status” in the material, the first step before proceeding is to…`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Mengapa jalur hasil bersih dan alat tercemar dipisahkan?`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                                  `Why are clean-product routes and contaminated equipment kept separate?`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Kasus: Wadah bersih tercampur dengan alat bekas menangani kematian. Tindakan yang paling tepat adalah…`}:                                                                                                                                                                    `Scenario: A clean container has been mixed with equipment used to handle mortalities. The most appropriate action is to…`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Dalam konteks lesson ini, apa arti 容器（ようき）?`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                                               `In this lesson, what does 容器（ようき） mean?`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Pada alur kerja «Higiene hasil dan rantai penyimpanan» dalam materi, langkah pertama sebelum tahap berikutnya adalah…`}:                                                                                                                                                     `In the workflow “Product hygiene and the storage chain” in the material, the first step before proceeding is to…`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `「水温を確認してください」 meminta apa?`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                `What does 「水温を確認してください」 ask you to do?`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Kasus: Instruksi berbunyi 「水温を確認してください」. Tindakan yang paling tepat adalah…`}:                                                                                                                                                                                               `Scenario: The instruction says 「水温を確認してください」. The most appropriate action is to…`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Dalam konteks lesson ini, apa arti 報告（ほうこく）?`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                                              `In this lesson, what does 報告（ほうこく） mean?`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Pada alur kerja «Laporan budi daya dan instruksi Jepang» dalam materi, langkah pertama sebelum tahap berikutnya adalah…`}:                                                                                                                                                   `In the workflow “Aquaculture reports and Japanese instructions” in the material, the first step before proceeding is to…`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Keputusan produk melibatkan riwayat perlakuan dan persyaratan yang tidak terlihat secara visual.`}:                                                                                                                                                                     `Product decisions depend on treatment history and requirements that cannot be determined visually.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Tunda keputusan pelepasan produk sampai status dikonfirmasi. Keputusan produk melibatkan riwayat perlakuan dan persyaratan yang tidak terlihat secara visual.`}:                                                                                                        `Delay the product-release decision until the status is confirmed. Product decisions depend on treatment history and requirements that cannot be determined visually.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `出荷 dibaca しゅっか dan berarti pengiriman. Kenali istilah ini sebelum mengikuti instruksi kerja.`}:                                                                                                                                                                         `出荷 is read しゅっか and means shipment. Learn this term before following work instructions.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Mulai dengan konfirmasikan lot mutu dan status perlakuan. Setelah itu: Siapkan rencana alat serta wadah panen → Tangani sesuai metode yang diizinkan → Catat jumlah dan penanganan hasil. Urutan ini berlaku pada kasus dan prosedur yang dijelaskan di lesson.`}:      `Start by confirming the quality lot and treatment status. Then: Prepare the equipment and harvest-container plan → Handle the crop using an authorized method → Record the quantity and handling of the harvest. This sequence applies to the scenarios and procedures explained in the lesson.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Pemisahan dan pengolahan alat membantu mengendalikan kontaminasi silang.`}:                                                                                                                                                                                             `Separation and proper equipment processing help control cross-contamination.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Pisahkan dan proses alat sesuai higiene sebelum kontak produk. Pemisahan dan pengolahan alat membantu mengendalikan kontaminasi silang.`}:                                                                                                                              `Separate the equipment and sanitize it before it contacts products. Separation and proper equipment processing help control cross-contamination.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `容器 dibaca ようき dan berarti wadah. Kenali istilah ini sebelum mengikuti instruksi kerja.`}:                                                                                                                                                                               `容器 is read ようき and means container. Learn this term before following work instructions.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Mulai dengan cocokkan produk dengan metode penanganan. Setelah itu: Periksa kebersihan alat dan area → Pantau kondisi penyimpanan sesuai spesifikasi → Labeli lot serta laporkan penyimpangan. Urutan ini berlaku pada kasus dan prosedur yang dijelaskan di lesson.`}: `Start by matching the product with its handling method. Then: Check equipment and area cleanliness → Monitor storage conditions against specifications → Label the lot and report deviations. This sequence applies to the scenarios and procedures explained in the lesson.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `水温 berarti suhu air dan 確認 berarti memeriksa atau mengonfirmasi.`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                     `水温 means water temperature, and 確認 means to check or confirm.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Periksa suhu air sesuai metode yang ditetapkan. 水温 berarti suhu air dan 確認 berarti memeriksa atau mengonfirmasi.`}:                                                                                                                                                     `Check the water temperature using the specified method. 水温 means water temperature, and 確認 means to check or confirm.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `報告 dibaca ほうこく dan berarti laporan. Kenali istilah ini sebelum mengikuti instruksi kerja.`}:                                                                                                                                                                            `報告 is read ほうこく and means report. Learn this term before following work instructions.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Mulai dengan baca unit waktu parameter dan satuan. Setelah itu: Konfirmasikan instruksi yang belum jelas → Catat hasil aktual secara objektif → Serahkan laporan dan tugas tindak lanjut. Urutan ini berlaku pada kasus dan prosedur yang dijelaskan di lesson.`}:      `Start by reading the parameter units, time, and measurement units. Then: Confirm any unclear instructions → Record actual results objectively → Hand over the report and follow-up tasks. This sequence applies to the scenarios and procedures explained in the lesson.`,
	{field: "ssw.passage", source: `Catatan perlakuan kelompok belum lengkap menjelang panen.`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                                `Treatment records for a group are incomplete as harvest approaches.`,
	{field: "ssw.passage", source: `Wadah bersih tercampur dengan alat bekas menangani kematian.`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                             `A clean container has been mixed with equipment used to handle mortalities.`,
	{field: "ssw.passage", source: `Instruksi berbunyi 「水温を確認してください」.`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        `The instruction says 「水温を確認してください」.`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Tidak catatan dan ketentuan produk tetap perlu dipastikan`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                                 `No; records and product requirements still need to be confirmed`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Ya selalu`}:                                                     `Yes, always`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Ya jika jumlah sedikit`}:                                        `Yes, if the quantity is small`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Ya setelah diganti wadah`}:                                      `Yes, after changing the container`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Hapus catatan lama`}:                                            `Delete the old records`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Campur ke lot tanpa perlakuan`}:                                 `Mix it into an untreated lot`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Tunda keputusan pelepasan produk sampai status dikonfirmasi`}:   `Delay the product-release decision until the status is confirmed`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Kirim bila ikan tampak sehat`}:                                  `Ship it if the fish look healthy`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `pengiriman`}:                                                    `shipment`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `masa henti obat`}:                                               `medication withdrawal period`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `mutu`}:                                                          `quality`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `persiapan`}:                                                     `preparation`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Tangani sesuai metode yang diizinkan`}:                          `Handle the crop using an authorized method`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Catat jumlah dan penanganan hasil`}:                             `Record the quantity and handling of the harvest`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Konfirmasikan lot mutu dan status perlakuan`}:                   `Confirm the quality lot and treatment status`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Siapkan rencana alat serta wadah panen`}:                        `Prepare the equipment and harvest-container plan`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Menambah berat hasil`}:                                          `Increase the catch weight`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Menggantikan label`}:                                            `Replace the label`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Membuat semua suhu sama`}:                                       `Make all temperatures the same`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Mencegah perpindahan pencemar ke produk`}:                       `Prevent contaminants from reaching the product`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Campur ke semua lot`}:                                           `Mix it into all lots`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Pisahkan dan proses alat sesuai higiene sebelum kontak produk`}: `Separate the equipment and sanitize it before it contacts products`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Gunakan asal tidak berbau`}:                                     `Use it as long as it does not smell`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Tutupi dengan es`}:                                              `Cover it with ice`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `wadah`}:                                                         `container`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `penjagaan suhu dingin`}:                                         `cold-temperature control`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `kontaminasi`}:                                                   `contamination`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `higiene`}:                                                       `hygiene`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Labeli lot serta laporkan penyimpangan`}:                        `Label the lot and report deviations`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Cocokkan produk dengan metode penanganan`}:                      `Match the product with its handling method`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Periksa kebersihan alat dan area`}:                              `Check equipment and area cleanliness`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Pantau kondisi penyimpanan sesuai spesifikasi`}:                 `Monitor storage conditions against specifications`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Menghitung harga kapal`}:                                        `Calculate the vessel's price`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Membuka semua jaring`}:                                          `Open all nets`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Memeriksa suhu air`}:                                            `Check the water temperature`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Menambah pakan`}:                                                `Add feed`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Periksa suhu air sesuai metode yang ditetapkan`}:                `Check the water temperature using the specified method`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Tambah pakan langsung`}:                                         `Add feed immediately`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Ganti label kelompok`}:                                          `Change the group label`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Ukur berat wadah saja`}:                                         `Measure only the container weight`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `laporan`}:                                                       `report`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `satuan`}:                                                        `unit`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `suhu air`}:                                                      `water temperature`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `jumlah pakan`}:                                                  `feed amount`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Baca unit waktu parameter dan satuan`}:                          `Read the parameter units, time, and measurement units`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Konfirmasikan instruksi yang belum jelas`}:                      `Confirm any unclear instructions`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Catat hasil aktual secara objektif`}:                            `Record actual results objectively`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Serahkan laporan dan tugas tindak lanjut`}:                      `Hand over the report and follow-up tasks`,
}

var englishSSWFoodManufacturingHygieneCatalog = map[examSSWEnglishKey]string{
	{field: "ssw.group", source: `Higiene pekerja dan pencegahan cemaran`}:                                         `Worker Hygiene and Contamination Prevention`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Mengapa pemeriksaan kesehatan dan pakaian dilakukan sebelum menangani pangan?`}: `Why are health and clothing checks done before handling food?`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Di tempat kerja, situasinya: Sebelum giliran dimulai, seorang pekerja mengalami diare dan akan memakai sarung tangan untuk mengemas produk siap makan. Tindakan yang paling tepat adalah…`}:                                                    `Workplace scenario: Before the shift starts, a worker has diarrhea and plans to wear gloves to package ready-to-eat products. The most appropriate action is to…`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Dalam alur «Pemeriksaan kesehatan dan masuk area produksi», setelah langkah pertama selesai, apa tindakan berikutnya?`}:                                                                                                                        `In the workflow “Health check and entry to the production area,” what should you do after completing the first step?`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Apa yang harus dilakukan sebelum memakai sarung tangan baru setelah menyentuh tempat sampah?`}:                                                                                                                                                 `What should you do before putting on new gloves after touching a waste bin?`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Di tempat kerja, situasinya: Pekerja menyentuh gagang tempat sampah dengan sarung tangan, lalu hendak mengisi wadah produk siap makan. Tindakan yang paling tepat adalah…`}:                                                                    `Workplace scenario: A worker touches a waste-bin handle with gloves, then is about to fill a ready-to-eat product container. The most appropriate action is to…`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Dalam alur «Cuci tangan dan penggantian sarung tangan», setelah langkah pertama selesai, apa tindakan berikutnya?`}:                                                                                                                            `In the workflow “Handwashing and glove replacement,” what should you do after completing the first step?`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Apa urutan umum untuk menyiapkan alat yang kotor agar digunakan kembali?`}:                                                                                                                                                                     `What is the general sequence for preparing dirty equipment for reuse?`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Di tempat kerja, situasinya: Wadah berlabel bersih jatuh ke lantai dekat area bahan mentah; pekerja ingin segera menggunakannya kembali. Tindakan yang paling tepat adalah…`}:                                                                  `Workplace scenario: A container labeled clean falls on the floor near the raw-material area, and a worker wants to reuse it immediately. The most appropriate action is to…`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Dalam alur «Pembersihan alat dan pemisahan zona», setelah langkah pertama selesai, apa tindakan berikutnya?`}:                                                                                                                                  `In the workflow “Equipment cleaning and zone separation,” what should you do after completing the first step?`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Gejala, luka, pakaian, dan rambut dapat menjadi sumber cemaran; laporkan kondisi bermasalah sebelum bekerja.`}:                                                                                                                            `Symptoms, wounds, clothing, and hair can be sources of contamination; report any problem before starting work.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Sarung tangan tidak menghapus risiko penyakit. Laporkan gejala dan tunggu arahan tugas.`}:                                                                                                                                                 `Gloves do not eliminate the risk of illness. Report the symptoms and wait for work instructions.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Urutan yang diajarkan: Baca aturan masuk untuk zona produksi → Periksa kondisi tubuh dan laporkan gejala atau luka → Kenakan pakaian dan penutup rambut sesuai aturan → Minta pemeriksaan ulang sebelum mulai menangani pangan.`}:         `The taught sequence is: Read the entry rules for the production zone → Check your physical condition and report symptoms or wounds → Wear clothing and hair covering as required → Request a recheck before handling food.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Tangan kotor dapat mencemari sarung tangan baru saat dikenakan; cuci tangan terlebih dahulu.`}:                                                                                                                                            `Dirty hands can contaminate new gloves when putting them on; wash your hands first.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Sarung tangan telah menyentuh sampah; hentikan kontak, buang, cuci tangan, dan ganti.`}:                                                                                                                                                   `The gloves have touched waste; stop contact with the product, discard the gloves, wash your hands, and put on new ones.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Urutan yang diajarkan: Hentikan kontak dengan produk dan buang sarung tangan yang kotor → Cuci tangan sesuai urutan yang dipasang → Keringkan dan lakukan sanitasi sesuai prosedur → Pakai sarung tangan baru bila tugas memerlukannya.`}: `The taught sequence is: Stop contact with the product and discard the soiled gloves → Wash your hands in the posted sequence → Dry and sanitize according to procedure → Put on new gloves if the task requires them.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Alat kotor tidak boleh kembali ke alur bersih sebelum melalui langkah yang ditentukan fasilitas.`}:                                                                                                                                        `Dirty equipment must not return to the clean workflow until it has gone through the facility's required steps.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Jatuh ke lantai membuat status kebersihan tidak dapat diasumsikan; pisahkan dan minta pemrosesan ulang.`}:                                                                                                                                 `After falling on the floor, the container's cleanliness cannot be assumed; separate it and request reprocessing.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Urutan yang diajarkan: Kenali batas zona dan label status alat → Ambil alat bersih dari tempat yang ditetapkan → Pisahkan alat bekas ke tempat pencucian → Laporkan alat atau permukaan yang terkena cemaran.`}:                           `The taught sequence is: Identify zone boundaries and equipment-status labels → Take clean equipment from its designated place → Separate used equipment in the washing area → Report equipment or surfaces that may be contaminated.`,
	{field: "ssw.passage", source: `Sebelum giliran dimulai, seorang pekerja mengalami diare dan akan memakai sarung tangan untuk mengemas produk siap makan.`}:                                                                                                                   `Before the shift starts, a worker has diarrhea and plans to wear gloves to package ready-to-eat products.`,
	{field: "ssw.passage", source: `Pekerja menyentuh gagang tempat sampah dengan sarung tangan, lalu hendak mengisi wadah produk siap makan.`}:                                                                                                                                   `A worker touches a waste-bin handle with gloves, then is about to fill a ready-to-eat product container.`,
	{field: "ssw.passage", source: `Wadah berlabel bersih jatuh ke lantai dekat area bahan mentah; pekerja ingin segera menggunakannya kembali.`}:                                                                                                                                 `A container labeled clean falls on the floor near the raw-material area, and a worker wants to reuse it immediately.`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Untuk mencegah cemaran dari pekerja masuk ke produk`}:                                                                                                                                                                                          `To prevent worker-borne contamination from reaching the product`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Agar catatan produksi tidak perlu dibuat`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                     `So production records do not need to be made`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Untuk mengganti pemeriksaan suhu bahan`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                       `To replace temperature checks of ingredients`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Supaya pekerja dapat melewati aturan zona`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                    `So workers can bypass zone rules`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Lanjutkan dengan angka atau bahan perkiraan tanpa melapor`}:                                                                                                                                                                                    `Continue using estimated figures or ingredients without reporting it`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Pindahkan produk ke kelompok lain agar target terpenuhi`}:                                                                                                                                                                                      `Move the product to another group to meet the target`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Laporkan gejala kepada pemimpin dan jangan menangani pangan; tunggu penetapan tugas aman sesuai prosedur fasilitas.`}:                                                                                                                          `Report the symptoms to the supervisor and do not handle food; wait for a safe work assignment according to facility procedure.`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Pakai sarung tangan dan tetap mengemas seperti biasa`}:                                                                                                                                                                                         `Put on gloves and continue packaging as usual`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Periksa kondisi tubuh dan laporkan gejala atau luka`}:                                                                                                                                                                                          `Check your physical condition and report symptoms or wounds`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Minta pemeriksaan ulang sebelum mulai menangani pangan`}:                                                                                                                                                                                       `Request a recheck before handling food`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Baca aturan masuk untuk zona produksi`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                        `Read the entry rules for the production zone`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Kenakan pakaian dan penutup rambut sesuai aturan`}:                                                                                                                                                                                             `Wear clothing and hair covering as required`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Pakai dua pasang sarung tangan tanpa mencuci tangan`}:                                                                                                                                                                                          `Put on two pairs of gloves without washing your hands`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Cuci tangan sesuai prosedur dahulu`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                           `Wash your hands according to procedure first`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Cukup semprot bagian luar sarung tangan lama`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                 `Just spray the outside of the old gloves`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Bilas pangan yang disentuh`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                                   `Rinse the food that was touched`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Jangan lanjut mengisi. Buang sarung tangan, cuci tangan sesuai prosedur, dan kenakan sarung tangan baru sebelum kembali ke produk.`}:                                                                                                           `Do not continue filling. Discard the gloves, wash your hands according to procedure, and put on new gloves before returning to the product.`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Keringkan dan lakukan sanitasi sesuai prosedur`}:                                                                                                                                                                                               `Dry and sanitize according to procedure`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Pakai sarung tangan baru bila tugas memerlukannya`}:                                                                                                                                                                                            `Put on new gloves if the task requires them`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Cuci tangan sesuai urutan yang dipasang`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                      `Wash your hands in the posted sequence`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Hentikan kontak dengan produk dan buang sarung tangan yang kotor`}:                                                                                                                                                                             `Stop contact with the product and discard the soiled gloves`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Campur dengan alat bersih agar kering bersama`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                `Mix it with clean equipment so it dries together`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Semprot bahan kimia di atas pangan`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                           `Spray chemicals over the food`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Pisahkan, bersihkan, lalu sanitasi sesuai prosedur`}:                                                                                                                                                                                           `Separate it, clean it, then sanitize it according to procedure`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Lap cepat dan letakkan di rak bersih`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                         `Wipe it quickly and put it on the clean shelf`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Pisahkan wadah itu sebagai belum siap pakai dan minta pencucian serta sanitasi ulang sesuai aturan fasilitas.`}:                                                                                                                                `Set the container aside as not ready for use and request washing and sanitizing again according to facility rules.`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Kenali batas zona dan label status alat`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                      `Identify zone boundaries and equipment-status labels`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Ambil alat bersih dari tempat yang ditetapkan`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                `Take clean equipment from its designated place`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Pisahkan alat bekas ke tempat pencucian`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                      `Separate used equipment in the washing area`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Laporkan alat atau permukaan yang terkena cemaran`}:                                                                                                                                                                                            `Report equipment or surfaces that may be contaminated`,
}

var englishSSWFoodManufacturingMaterialsCatalog = map[examSSWEnglishKey]string{
	{field: "ssw.group", source: `Penerimaan dan persiapan bahan`}:                       `Receiving and Preparing Ingredients`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Apa manfaat mencatat nomor lot saat bahan diterima?`}: `What is the benefit of recording the lot number when ingredients are received?`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Di tempat kerja, situasinya: Dokumen mencatat 12 kotak bahan, tetapi satu kotak bocor dan nomor lotnya berbeda dari daftar penerimaan. Tindakan yang paling tepat adalah…`}:                                                             `Workplace scenario: The documents list 12 boxes of ingredients, but one box is leaking and its lot number differs from the receiving list. The most appropriate action is to…`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Dalam alur «Pemeriksaan bahan yang datang», setelah langkah pertama selesai, apa tindakan berikutnya?`}:                                                                                                                                 `In the workflow “Inspecting incoming ingredients,” what should you do after completing the first step?`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Dari mana pekerja mengambil batas suhu untuk bahan tertentu?`}:                                                                                                                                                                          `Where should workers find the temperature limit for a particular ingredient?`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Di tempat kerja, situasinya: Catatan ruang pendingin menunjukkan suhu di atas batas kerja pada formulir, tetapi satu lot akan segera dipakai. Tindakan yang paling tepat adalah…`}:                                                      `Workplace scenario: The cold-room record shows a temperature above the limit on the form, but a lot is about to be used. The most appropriate action is to…`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Dalam alur «Penyimpanan dan pemantauan suhu», setelah langkah pertama selesai, apa tindakan berikutnya?`}:                                                                                                                               `In the workflow “Storage and temperature monitoring,” what should you do after completing the first step?`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Mengapa nama bahan dan lot dicocokkan sebelum menimbang resep?`}:                                                                                                                                                                        `Why should the ingredient name and lot be checked before weighing a recipe?`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Di tempat kerja, situasinya: Lembar formula meminta bubuk bahan A, tetapi wadah di meja berlabel bahan B dan pekerja belum mulai menimbang. Tindakan yang paling tepat adalah…`}:                                                        `Workplace scenario: The formula sheet calls for ingredient A powder, but the container on the table is labeled ingredient B and weighing has not begun. The most appropriate action is to…`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Dalam alur «Penimbangan resep dan urutan bahan», setelah langkah pertama selesai, apa tindakan berikutnya?`}:                                                                                                                            `In the workflow “Recipe weighing and ingredient sequence,” what should you do after completing the first step?`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Nomor lot membantu menelusuri bahan ketika ada selisih atau masalah pada produk.`}:                                                                                                                                                 `Lot numbers help trace ingredients when a discrepancy or product problem occurs.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Lot dan kemasan yang tidak cocok harus dipisahkan dan dicatat sebelum dipakai.`}:                                                                                                                                                   `A mismatched lot or package must be separated and recorded before use.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Urutan yang diajarkan: Cocokkan dokumen dan identitas lot → Periksa jumlah, kemasan, tanggal, dan syarat kondisi → Catat hasil pemeriksaan dan selisih aktual → Tahan bahan bermasalah serta minta keputusan.`}:                    `The taught sequence is: Match the documents and lot identity → Check the quantity, package, date, and required conditions → Record the inspection result and actual discrepancy → Hold any problem ingredients and request a decision.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Syarat suhu berbeda menurut bahan dan proses; gunakan batas yang ditetapkan dan catat hasilnya.`}:                                                                                                                                  `Temperature requirements vary by ingredient and process; use the specified limit and record the result.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Penyimpangan perlu dicatat dan ditahan untuk keputusan penanggung jawab, bukan diubah diam-diam.`}:                                                                                                                                 `Record and hold deviations for the person in charge to decide; do not silently alter them.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Urutan yang diajarkan: Baca syarat simpan pada spesifikasi atau label → Tempatkan lot di lokasi beridentitas yang benar → Ukur dan catat suhu sesuai jadwal fasilitas → Tahan serta laporkan penyimpangan sebelum bahan dipakai.`}: `The taught sequence is: Read the storage requirements on the specification or label → Place the lot in the correctly identified location → Measure and record the temperature on the facility schedule → Hold and report deviations before using the ingredient.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Pencocokan sebelum menimbang mencegah bahan salah masuk ke campuran dan menjaga penelusuran.`}:                                                                                                                                     `Checking before weighing prevents the wrong ingredient from entering the mixture and preserves traceability.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Label yang tidak cocok berarti identitas belum pasti; hentikan penimbangan sampai ada konfirmasi.`}:                                                                                                                                `A mismatched label means the identity is uncertain; stop weighing until it is confirmed.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Urutan yang diajarkan: Cocokkan formula, bahan, dan lot → Periksa satuan serta kondisi timbangan → Timbang dan catat tiap bahan secara terpisah → Tambahkan menurut urutan dan tandai hasil kerja.`}:                               `The taught sequence is: Match the formula, ingredients, and lot → Check the units and scale condition → Weigh and record each ingredient separately → Add ingredients in sequence and mark the work completed.`,
	{field: "ssw.passage", source: `Dokumen mencatat 12 kotak bahan, tetapi satu kotak bocor dan nomor lotnya berbeda dari daftar penerimaan.`}:                                                                                                                            `The documents list 12 boxes of ingredients, but one box is leaking and its lot number differs from the receiving list.`,
	{field: "ssw.passage", source: `Catatan ruang pendingin menunjukkan suhu di atas batas kerja pada formulir, tetapi satu lot akan segera dipakai.`}:                                                                                                                     `The cold-room record shows a temperature above the limit on the form, but a lot is about to be used.`,
	{field: "ssw.passage", source: `Lembar formula meminta bubuk bahan A, tetapi wadah di meja berlabel bahan B dan pekerja belum mulai menimbang.`}:                                                                                                                       `The formula sheet calls for ingredient A powder, but the container on the table is labeled ingredient B and weighing has not begun.`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Menggantikan pemeriksaan kondisi kemasan`}:                                                                                                                                                                                              `Replace package-condition checks`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Membuat semua bahan dapat dipakai tanpa batas`}:                                                                                                                                                                                         `Make all ingredients usable without restriction`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Menghapus kebutuhan catatan proses`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                    `Remove the need for process records`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Menghubungkan bahan dengan pemasok dan produk yang dibuat`}:                                                                                                                                                                             `Link ingredients to their supplier and the products made`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Pisahkan kotak bermasalah, catat jumlah dan nomor lot yang terlihat, lalu minta penanggung jawab memutuskan penerimaan.`}:                                                                                                               `Set the problem box aside, record its quantity and visible lot number, and ask the person in charge to decide whether to accept it.`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Cocokkan dokumen dan identitas lot`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                    `Match the documents and lot identity`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Periksa jumlah, kemasan, tanggal, dan syarat kondisi`}:                                                                                                                                                                                  `Check the quantity, package, date, and required conditions`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Catat hasil pemeriksaan dan selisih aktual`}:                                                                                                                                                                                            `Record the inspection result and actual discrepancy`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Tahan bahan bermasalah serta minta keputusan`}:                                                                                                                                                                                          `Hold any problem ingredients and request a decision`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Dari label atau spesifikasi dan rencana kendali fasilitas`}:                                                                                                                                                                             `From the label or specification and the facility control plan`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Dari perkiraan berdasarkan cuaca luar`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                 `From an estimate based on the outdoor weather`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Dari satu angka yang sama untuk semua pangan`}:                                                                                                                                                                                          `From one value used for all foods`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Dari jumlah bahan yang tersisa`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                        `From the remaining quantity of ingredients`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Tahan lot yang terdampak, catat waktu dan pembacaan, lalu laporkan agar penanggung jawab menentukan penanganannya.`}:                                                                                                                    `Hold the affected lot, record the time and reading, and report it so the person in charge can decide how to handle it.`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Baca syarat simpan pada spesifikasi atau label`}:                                                                                                                                                                                        `Read the storage requirements on the specification or label`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Tempatkan lot di lokasi beridentitas yang benar`}:                                                                                                                                                                                       `Place the lot in the correctly identified location`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Ukur dan catat suhu sesuai jadwal fasilitas`}:                                                                                                                                                                                           `Measure and record the temperature on the facility schedule`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Tahan serta laporkan penyimpangan sebelum bahan dipakai`}:                                                                                                                                                                               `Hold and report deviations before using the ingredient`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Agar catatan aktual tidak diperlukan`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                  `So actual records are unnecessary`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Agar campuran sesuai formula dan bahan dapat ditelusuri`}:                                                                                                                                                                               `So the mixture matches the formula and ingredients remain traceable`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Agar timbangan tidak perlu diperiksa`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                  `So the scale does not need to be checked`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Agar urutan formula dapat diubah bebas`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                `So the formula sequence can be changed freely`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Jangan mulai pencampuran. Pisahkan wadah, cocokkan identitas dengan daftar bahan, dan minta konfirmasi penanggung jawab.`}:                                                                                                              `Do not start mixing. Set the container aside, compare its identity with the ingredient list, and ask the person in charge to confirm.`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Timbang dan catat tiap bahan secara terpisah`}:                                                                                                                                                                                          `Weigh and record each ingredient separately`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Tambahkan menurut urutan dan tandai hasil kerja`}:                                                                                                                                                                                       `Add ingredients in sequence and mark the work completed`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Periksa satuan serta kondisi timbangan`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                `Check the units and scale condition`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Cocokkan formula, bahan, dan lot`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                      `Match the formula, ingredients, and lot`,
}

var englishSSWFoodManufacturingProcessingCatalog = map[examSSWEnglishKey]string{
	{field: "ssw.group", source: `Pengolahan, kendali mesin, dan alergen`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                                            `Processing, Machine Controls, and Allergens`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Mengapa pekerja memeriksa pelindung dan area mesin sebelum mulai?`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                `Why do workers check machine guards and the surrounding area before starting?`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Di tempat kerja, situasinya: Pelindung pada pengaduk terasa longgar, tetapi lini sedang mengejar jumlah produksi. Tindakan yang paling tepat adalah…`}:                                                                                                             `Workplace scenario: A mixer guard feels loose, but the line is trying to meet its production target. The most appropriate action is to…`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Dalam alur «Pemeriksaan awal mesin dan pelindung», setelah langkah pertama selesai, apa tindakan berikutnya?`}:                                                                                                                                                     `In the workflow “Pre-operation machine and guard checks,” what should you do after completing the first step?`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Apa yang dicatat saat memeriksa parameter proses?`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                                `What should be recorded when checking process parameters?`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Di tempat kerja, situasinya: Catatan pemanasan menunjukkan pembacaan belum mencapai batas pada instruksi produk, tetapi baki berikutnya sudah menunggu. Tindakan yang paling tepat adalah…`}:                                                                       `Workplace scenario: A heating record shows that the reading has not reached the limit in the product instructions, but the next tray is already waiting. The most appropriate action is to…`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Dalam alur «Kendali proses waktu dan suhu», setelah langkah pertama selesai, apa tindakan berikutnya?`}:                                                                                                                                                            `In the workflow “Time and temperature process controls,” what should you do after completing the first step?`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Apa yang perlu diverifikasi sebelum melepaskan produk setelah pergantian alergen?`}:                                                                                                                                                                                `What must be verified before releasing product after an allergen changeover?`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Di tempat kerja, situasinya: Setelah produk yang memakai susu, gulungan label produk tanpa susu dipasang sebelum catatan pembersihan pergantian selesai. Tindakan yang paling tepat adalah…`}:                                                                      `Workplace scenario: After a product containing milk, a roll of labels for a milk-free product is installed before the changeover cleaning record is complete. The most appropriate action is to…`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Dalam alur «Pergantian produk dan pengendalian alergen», setelah langkah pertama selesai, apa tindakan berikutnya?`}:                                                                                                                                               `In the workflow “Product changeover and allergen control,” what should you do after completing the first step?`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Pemeriksaan awal menemukan kondisi berbahaya sebelum alat bergerak dan produk masuk ke proses.`}:                                                                                                                                                              `Pre-operation checks find hazardous conditions before equipment moves and products enter the process.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Pelindung longgar adalah kondisi tidak aman; jangan jalankan mesin dan eskalasikan untuk pemeriksaan.`}:                                                                                                                                                       `A loose guard is unsafe; do not run the machine and escalate the issue for inspection.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Urutan yang diajarkan: Baca instruksi dan batas tugas operator → Periksa pelindung, tombol, kabel, dan area sekitar → Laporkan kerusakan atau keadaan tidak normal → Jalankan hanya setelah dinyatakan siap.`}:                                                `The taught sequence is: Read the instructions and limits of the operator's role → Check guards, buttons, cables, and the surrounding area → Report damage or abnormal conditions → Start only after the machine is declared ready.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Data aktual yang terkait dengan waktu dan lot membantu memastikan proses serta menelusuri dampak penyimpangan.`}:                                                                                                                                              `Actual data linked to time and lot helps verify the process and trace the impact of deviations.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Batas yang belum tercapai harus membuat produk ditahan dan penyimpangan dilaporkan untuk keputusan.`}:                                                                                                                                                         `If a limit has not been met, hold the product and report the deviation for a decision.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Urutan yang diajarkan: Cocokkan produk dengan instruksi kendali proses → Periksa alat ukur atau tampilan yang ditentukan → Catat waktu dan pembacaan aktual → Tahan produk terdampak dan laporkan penyimpangan.`}:                                             `The taught sequence is: Match the product with the process-control instructions → Check the specified measuring device or display → Record the time and actual reading → Hold affected product and report deviations.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Residu, bahan, dan label harus sesuai dengan spesifikasi produk berikutnya; bila belum terverifikasi, produk ditahan.`}:                                                                                                                                       `Residues, ingredients, and labels must match the next product's specifications; hold product until this is verified.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Pembersihan pergantian belum selesai, sehingga lini dan produk harus ditahan sampai verifikasi dilakukan.`}:                                                                                                                                                   `Changeover cleaning is not complete, so hold the line and product until verification is finished.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Urutan yang diajarkan: Baca spesifikasi dan matriks alergen produk berikutnya → Pisahkan produk lama dan hentikan alur sesuai instruksi → Bersihkan atau ganti alat menurut prosedur yang berlaku → Verifikasi bahan dan label sebelum melepas produk baru.`}: `The taught sequence is: Read the next product's specifications and allergen matrix → Separate the previous product and stop the flow as instructed → Clean or replace equipment according to procedure → Verify ingredients and labels before releasing the new product.`,
	{field: "ssw.passage", source: `Pelindung pada pengaduk terasa longgar, tetapi lini sedang mengejar jumlah produksi.`}:                                                                                                                                                                            `A mixer guard feels loose, but the line is trying to meet its production target.`,
	{field: "ssw.passage", source: `Catatan pemanasan menunjukkan pembacaan belum mencapai batas pada instruksi produk, tetapi baki berikutnya sudah menunggu.`}:                                                                                                                                      `A heating record shows that the reading has not reached the limit in the product instructions, but the next tray is already waiting.`,
	{field: "ssw.passage", source: `Setelah produk yang memakai susu, gulungan label produk tanpa susu dipasang sebelum catatan pembersihan pergantian selesai.`}:                                                                                                                                     `After a product containing milk, a roll of labels for a milk-free product is installed before the changeover cleaning record is complete.`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Untuk mengganti pelatihan operator`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                                               `Replace operator training`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Supaya kerusakan kecil tidak perlu dilaporkan`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                                    `So minor damage does not need to be reported`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Untuk mengurangi risiko tersangkut, terjepit, atau tercemar benda lepas`}:                                                                                                                                                                                          `Reduce the risk of entanglement, crushing, or contamination by loose objects`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Agar mesin berjalan tanpa daftar kerja`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                                           `Allow the machine to run without a work checklist`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Jangan menyalakan pengaduk. Jauhkan orang dari area berbahaya dan beri tahu pemimpin agar mesin diperiksa.`}:                                                                                                                                                       `Do not start the mixer. Keep people away from the hazard and tell the supervisor so the machine can be inspected.`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Baca instruksi dan batas tugas operator`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                                          `Read the instructions and limits of the operator's role`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Periksa pelindung, tombol, kabel, dan area sekitar`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                               `Check guards, buttons, cables, and the surrounding area`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Laporkan kerusakan atau keadaan tidak normal`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                                     `Report damage or abnormal conditions`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Jalankan hanya setelah dinyatakan siap`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                                           `Start only after the machine is declared ready`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Hanya angka target pada instruksi`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                                                `Only the target value in the instructions`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Perkiraan hasil setelah mesin selesai`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                                            `An estimate after the machine finishes`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Nama pekerja tanpa pembacaan`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     `The worker's name without a reading`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Hasil aktual, waktu, dan identitas produk atau lot`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                               `The actual result, time, and product or lot identity`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Hentikan pelepasan lot, tahan produk yang terdampak, catat pembacaan dan waktu, lalu minta keputusan penanggung jawab.`}:                                                                                                                                           `Stop lot release, hold affected product, record the reading and time, and request a decision from the person in charge.`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Cocokkan produk dengan instruksi kendali proses`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                                  `Match the product with the process-control instructions`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Periksa alat ukur atau tampilan yang ditentukan`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                                  `Check the specified measuring device or display`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Catat waktu dan pembacaan aktual`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 `Record the time and actual reading`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Tahan produk terdampak dan laporkan penyimpangan`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                                 `Hold affected product and report deviations`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Pembersihan sesuai prosedur, bahan, dan label produk baru`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                        `Cleaning according to procedure, ingredients, and the new product label`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Hanya warna kemasan yang baru`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    `Only the new package color`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Jumlah produk pada giliran sebelumnya`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                                            `The quantity of product from the previous shift`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Perkiraan bahwa sisa bahan sudah hilang`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                                          `An assumption that all ingredient residue is gone`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Hentikan lini dan tahan produk sejak pergantian label; laporkan urutan kejadian dan tunggu pemeriksaan pembersihan serta label.`}:                                                                                                                                  `Stop the line and hold product from the label change onward; report the sequence of events and wait for cleaning and label checks.`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Baca spesifikasi dan matriks alergen produk berikutnya`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                           `Read the next product's specifications and allergen matrix`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Pisahkan produk lama dan hentikan alur sesuai instruksi`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                          `Separate the previous product and stop the flow as instructed`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Bersihkan atau ganti alat menurut prosedur yang berlaku`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                          `Clean or replace equipment according to procedure`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Verifikasi bahan dan label sebelum melepas produk baru`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                           `Verify ingredients and labels before releasing the new product`,
}

var englishSSWFoodManufacturingQualityCatalog = map[examSSWEnglishKey]string{
	{field: "ssw.group", source: `Kemasan, pemeriksaan mutu, dan ketertelusuran`}:                                                                                                                                                                                         `Packaging, Quality Checks, and Traceability`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Mengapa label diperiksa kembali saat gulungan atau produk berganti?`}:                                                                                                                                                                  `Why is the label checked again when a roll or product changes?`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Di tempat kerja, situasinya: Kode label pada gulungan baru berbeda satu angka dari lembar produksi; beberapa bungkus sudah dibuat. Tindakan yang paling tepat adalah…`}:                                                                `Workplace scenario: The label code on a new roll differs by one digit from the production sheet, and some packages have already been made. The most appropriate action is to…`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Dalam alur «Pemeriksaan kemasan dan label produk», setelah langkah pertama selesai, apa tindakan berikutnya?`}:                                                                                                                         `In the workflow “Package and product-label checks,” what should you do after completing the first step?`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Informasi apa yang membantu menelusuri produk setelah benda asing ditemukan?`}:                                                                                                                                                         `What information helps trace products after a foreign object is found?`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Di tempat kerja, situasinya: Seorang pekerja melihat serpihan plastik di dekat produk di konveyor dan tidak tahu apakah serpihan berasal dari kemasan. Tindakan yang paling tepat adalah…`}:                                            `Workplace scenario: A worker sees a plastic fragment near a product on the conveyor and does not know whether it came from the package. The most appropriate action is to…`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Dalam alur «Pemeriksaan cacat dan benda asing», setelah langkah pertama selesai, apa tindakan berikutnya?`}:                                                                                                                            `In the workflow “Defect and foreign-object checks,” what should you do after completing the first step?`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Apa yang membuat catatan serah terima berguna bagi giliran berikutnya?`}:                                                                                                                                                               `What makes a handover record useful to the next shift?`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Di tempat kerja, situasinya: Pada akhir giliran, satu lot masih menunggu pemeriksaan label, tetapi pekerja berikutnya hanya menerima catatan jumlah produksi. Tindakan yang paling tepat adalah…`}:                                     `Workplace scenario: At the end of a shift, a lot is still awaiting a label check, but the next worker receives only the production quantity record. The most appropriate action is to…`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Dalam alur «Catatan produksi dan serah terima lot», setelah langkah pertama selesai, apa tindakan berikutnya?`}:                                                                                                                        `In the workflow “Production records and lot handover,” what should you do after completing the first step?`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Pencocokan label mencegah informasi yang salah menempel pada produk yang benar.`}:                                                                                                                                                 `Checking the label prevents incorrect information from being attached to the right product.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Kode berbeda menandakan potensi salah label; hentikan, tahan produk terkait, dan eskalasikan.`}:                                                                                                                                   `A different code indicates a possible mislabel; stop, hold the affected product, and escalate the issue.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Urutan yang diajarkan: Cocokkan kode produk dan lot dengan instruksi → Periksa label, informasi alergen, dan tanggal → Periksa segel serta keadaan kemasan → Tahan dan laporkan setiap ketidakcocokan.`}:                          `The taught sequence is: Match the product and lot code to the instructions → Check the label, allergen information, and date → Check the seal and package condition → Hold and report any mismatch.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Fakta ini membantu menentukan cakupan produk yang perlu ditahan dan diperiksa.`}:                                                                                                                                                  `These facts help determine which products must be held and inspected.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Sumber dan cakupan belum jelas; tahan aliran dan laporkan fakta untuk penilaian.`}:                                                                                                                                                `The source and scope are unclear; hold the flow and report the facts for assessment.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Urutan yang diajarkan: Amati produk dan perhatikan alarm alat pemeriksa → Hentikan atau alihkan aliran sesuai instruksi → Pisahkan produk terkait dengan identitas lot → Catat temuan dan serahkan untuk pemeriksaan.`}:           `The taught sequence is: Observe the product and watch for inspection-equipment alarms → Stop or divert the flow as instructed → Separate affected products by lot identity → Record the finding and submit it for inspection.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Informasi rinci menjaga pekerjaan terbuka terlihat dan membantu tindak lanjut yang benar.`}:                                                                                                                                       `Detailed information keeps open work visible and supports proper follow-up.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Pemeriksaan label belum selesai; status, lokasi, dan tindak lanjut harus dicatat serta diserahkan.`}:                                                                                                                              `The label check is not complete; record and hand over the status, location, and follow-up.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Urutan yang diajarkan: Catat waktu, lot, proses, dan hasil aktual → Tandai produk atau proses yang masih ditahan → Jelaskan tindakan serta pekerjaan yang belum selesai → Serahkan informasi dan pastikan penerima memahaminya.`}: `The taught sequence is: Record the time, lot, process, and actual result → Mark products or processes still on hold → Explain actions taken and unfinished work → Hand over the information and confirm the recipient understands it.`,
	{field: "ssw.passage", source: `Kode label pada gulungan baru berbeda satu angka dari lembar produksi; beberapa bungkus sudah dibuat.`}:                                                                                                                               `The label code on a new roll differs by one digit from the production sheet, and some packages have already been made.`,
	{field: "ssw.passage", source: `Seorang pekerja melihat serpihan plastik di dekat produk di konveyor dan tidak tahu apakah serpihan berasal dari kemasan.`}:                                                                                                           `A worker sees a plastic fragment near a product on the conveyor and does not know whether it came from the package.`,
	{field: "ssw.passage", source: `Pada akhir giliran, satu lot masih menunggu pemeriksaan label, tetapi pekerja berikutnya hanya menerima catatan jumlah produksi.`}:                                                                                                    `At the end of a shift, a lot is still awaiting a label check, but the next worker receives only the production quantity record.`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Agar nomor lot dapat dihapus setelah dicetak`}:                                                                                                                                                                                         `So the lot number can be removed after printing`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Untuk memastikan produk, lot, tanggal, dan informasi yang dicetak cocok`}:                                                                                                                                                              `To ensure the product, lot, date, and printed information match`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Supaya pemeriksaan isi produk dapat dilewati`}:                                                                                                                                                                                         `So product-content checks can be skipped`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Untuk memakai label apa saja demi mempercepat`}:                                                                                                                                                                                        `Use any label to save time`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Hentikan pengemasan, tahan bungkus sejak titik pemeriksaan terakhir, catat jumlah dan kode, lalu laporkan untuk pemeriksaan ulang.`}:                                                                                                   `Stop packaging, hold packages since the last check, record the quantity and code, and report the issue for reinspection.`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Periksa segel serta keadaan kemasan`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                  `Check the seal and package condition`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Tahan dan laporkan setiap ketidakcocokan`}:                                                                                                                                                                                             `Hold and report any mismatch`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Periksa label, informasi alergen, dan tanggal`}:                                                                                                                                                                                        `Check the label, allergen information, and date`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Cocokkan kode produk dan lot dengan instruksi`}:                                                                                                                                                                                        `Match the product and lot code to the instructions`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Hanya jumlah produk pada hari itu`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                    `Only the quantity of products made that day`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Perkiraan sumber tanpa waktu atau nomor lot`}:                                                                                                                                                                                          `An estimated source without a time or lot number`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Waktu, mesin atau lokasi, lot, jumlah, dan pemeriksaan terakhir`}:                                                                                                                                                                      `The time, machine or location, lot, quantity, and last inspection`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Warna baju pekerja saja`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                              `Only the worker's clothing color`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Hentikan atau tahan aliran sesuai instruksi, pisahkan produk terkait, dan laporkan lokasi serta waktu temuan untuk pemeriksaan.`}:                                                                                                      `Stop or hold the flow as instructed, separate affected products, and report the location and time of the finding for inspection.`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Amati produk dan perhatikan alarm alat pemeriksa`}:                                                                                                                                                                                     `Observe the product and watch for inspection-equipment alarms`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Hentikan atau alihkan aliran sesuai instruksi`}:                                                                                                                                                                                        `Stop or divert the flow as instructed`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Pisahkan produk terkait dengan identitas lot`}:                                                                                                                                                                                         `Separate affected products by lot identity`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Catat temuan dan serahkan untuk pemeriksaan`}:                                                                                                                                                                                          `Record the finding and submit it for inspection`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Hanya menyebut bahwa produksi berjalan lambat`}:                                                                                                                                                                                        `Only mention that production was slow`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Menghapus semua status tahan sebelum pergantian`}:                                                                                                                                                                                      `Clear all hold statuses before the shift change`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Menulis perkiraan penyebab tanpa data`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                `Write an estimated cause without data`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Menyebut lot, lokasi, fakta, tindakan, dan pekerjaan yang masih terbuka`}:                                                                                                                                                              `State the lot, location, facts, actions, and unfinished work`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Tambahkan status lot, lokasi tahan, alasan dan pemeriksaan terbuka sesuai aturan koreksi, lalu serahkan langsung kepada penerima giliran.`}:                                                                                            `Add the lot status, hold location, reason, and outstanding check according to correction rules, then hand it directly to the next shift worker.`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Catat waktu, lot, proses, dan hasil aktual`}:                                                                                                                                                                                           `Record the time, lot, process, and actual result`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Tandai produk atau proses yang masih ditahan`}:                                                                                                                                                                                         `Mark products or processes still on hold`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Jelaskan tindakan serta pekerjaan yang belum selesai`}:                                                                                                                                                                                 `Explain actions taken and unfinished work`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Serahkan informasi dan pastikan penerima memahaminya`}:                                                                                                                                                                                 `Hand over the information and confirm the recipient understands it`,
}

var englishSSWFoodServiceHygieneCatalog = map[examSSWEnglishKey]string{
	{field: "ssw.group", source: `Higiene dan keamanan pangan`}:                                                    `Hygiene and Food Safety`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Apa yang harus dilakukan pekerja bila mengalami gejala sakit sebelum giliran?`}: `What should a worker do if they have symptoms of illness before a shift?`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Di tempat kerja, situasinya: Sebelum menyiapkan salad, seorang pekerja merasa mual dan muntah sejak pagi, tetapi restoran sedang ramai. Tindakan yang paling tepat adalah…`}:                                                                            `Workplace scenario: Before preparing a salad, a worker has felt nauseated and has been vomiting since morning, but the restaurant is busy. The most appropriate action is to…`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Dalam alur «Kondisi tubuh dan persiapan sebelum giliran», setelah langkah pertama selesai, apa tindakan berikutnya?`}:                                                                                                                                   `In the workflow “Physical condition and pre-shift preparation,” what should you do after completing the first step?`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Mengapa alat untuk bahan mentah dipisahkan dari alat makanan siap makan?`}:                                                                                                                                                                              `Why are tools for raw ingredients kept separate from tools for ready-to-eat food?`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Di tempat kerja, situasinya: Setelah memotong ayam mentah, pekerja mengambil irisan tomat dengan sarung tangan yang sama untuk salad. Tindakan yang paling tepat adalah…`}:                                                                              `Workplace scenario: After cutting raw chicken, a worker uses the same gloves to pick up tomato slices for a salad. The most appropriate action is to…`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Dalam alur «Cuci tangan dan pisahkan bahan mentah», setelah langkah pertama selesai, apa tindakan berikutnya?`}:                                                                                                                                         `In the workflow “Handwashing and raw-ingredient separation,” what should you do after completing the first step?`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Bagaimana pekerja menentukan batas waktu atau suhu untuk bahan?`}:                                                                                                                                                                                       `How should workers determine a time or temperature limit for an ingredient?`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Di tempat kerja, situasinya: Sup yang akan disajikan tidak memiliki label waktu, dan termometer stasiun sedang menunjukkan pesan kesalahan. Tindakan yang paling tepat adalah…`}:                                                                        `Workplace scenario: Soup ready to be served has no time label, and the station thermometer shows an error. The most appropriate action is to…`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Dalam alur «Waktu, suhu, dan penyimpanan bahan», setelah langkah pertama selesai, apa tindakan berikutnya?`}:                                                                                                                                            `In the workflow “Ingredient time, temperature, and storage,” what should you do after completing the first step?`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Pemimpin perlu mengetahui gejala agar dapat menentukan tugas dan mencegah makanan terpapar.`}:                                                                                                                                                      `The supervisor needs to know about symptoms to assign duties and prevent food exposure.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Gejala harus dilaporkan. Jangan menyiapkan makanan sampai pemimpin memberi arahan.`}:                                                                                                                                                               `Report the symptoms. Do not prepare food until the supervisor gives instructions.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Urutan yang diajarkan: Ganti pakaian dan perlengkapan sesuai aturan restoran → Periksa kondisi tubuh dan tangan → Laporkan gejala atau luka kepada pemimpin → Mulai tugas setelah mendapat arahan.`}:                                               `The taught sequence is: Change into clothing and equipment required by restaurant rules → Check your physical condition and hands → Report symptoms or wounds to the supervisor → Start work after receiving instructions.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Pemisahan mengurangi kemungkinan cemaran dari bahan mentah berpindah ke hidangan siap makan.`}:                                                                                                                                                     `Separation reduces the chance of contaminants from raw ingredients reaching ready-to-eat dishes.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Alat dan bahan yang mungkin terkena harus dihentikan, dipisahkan, dan ditangani ulang sesuai arahan.`}:                                                                                                                                             `Stop using, separate, and reprocess tools and ingredients that may have been contaminated, following instructions.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Urutan yang diajarkan: Kenali label atau kode alat untuk tiap jenis bahan → Pisahkan bahan mentah dari makanan siap makan → Cuci tangan setelah kontak dengan bahan mentah atau tugas kotor → Bersihkan atau ganti alat sebelum berpindah tugas.`}: `The taught sequence is: Identify tool labels or codes for each ingredient type → Separate raw ingredients from ready-to-eat food → Wash hands after contact with raw ingredients or dirty tasks → Clean or replace tools before switching tasks.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Batas mengikuti syarat bahan dan rencana restoran; ukur serta catat hasil aktual.`}:                                                                                                                                                                `Limits follow ingredient requirements and the restaurant plan; measure and record actual results.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Tanpa waktu yang dapat ditelusuri dan alat yang berfungsi, bahan tidak boleh langsung disajikan.`}:                                                                                                                                                 `Without traceable time records and working equipment, the food must not be served.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Urutan yang diajarkan: Baca label waktu dan syarat penyimpanan → Gunakan alat ukur sesuai instruksi → Catat waktu dan suhu aktual → Tahan bahan yang menyimpang dan laporkan.`}:                                                                    `The taught sequence is: Read the time label and storage requirements → Use the measuring tool as instructed → Record the actual time and temperature → Hold ingredients outside the limits and report them.`,
	{field: "ssw.passage", source: `Sebelum menyiapkan salad, seorang pekerja merasa mual dan muntah sejak pagi, tetapi restoran sedang ramai.`}:                                                                                                                                           `Before preparing a salad, a worker has felt nauseated and has been vomiting since morning, but the restaurant is busy.`,
	{field: "ssw.passage", source: `Setelah memotong ayam mentah, pekerja mengambil irisan tomat dengan sarung tangan yang sama untuk salad.`}:                                                                                                                                             `After cutting raw chicken, a worker uses the same gloves to pick up tomato slices for a salad.`,
	{field: "ssw.passage", source: `Sup yang akan disajikan tidak memiliki label waktu, dan termometer stasiun sedang menunjukkan pesan kesalahan.`}:                                                                                                                                       `Soup ready to be served has no time label, and the station thermometer shows an error.`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Melapor kepada pemimpin sebelum menangani makanan`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                     `Report it to the supervisor before handling food`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Memakai dua lapis sarung tangan lalu bekerja`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                          `Wear two layers of gloves and work`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Menunggu sampai pelanggan bertanya`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                                    `Wait until a customer asks`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Menyimpan gejala sampai giliran selesai`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                               `Keep the symptoms to yourself until the shift ends`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Beri tahu pemimpin, jangan menyiapkan makanan, dan tunggu penetapan tugas sesuai prosedur restoran.`}:                                                                                                                                                   `Tell the supervisor, do not prepare food, and wait for a work assignment according to restaurant procedure.`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Pakai alat yang sama karena pelanggan sedang menunggu`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                 `Use the same tools because customers are waiting`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Abaikan tiket lalu lanjutkan pesanan biasa`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                            `Ignore the ticket and continue with the usual order`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Tebak isi atau alergi dari nama hidangan`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                              `Guess the ingredients or allergens from the dish name`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Ganti pakaian dan perlengkapan sesuai aturan restoran`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                 `Change into clothing and equipment required by restaurant rules`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Mulai tugas setelah mendapat arahan`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                                   `Start work after receiving instructions`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Periksa kondisi tubuh dan tangan`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                                      `Check your physical condition and hands`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Laporkan gejala atau luka kepada pemimpin`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                             `Report symptoms or wounds to the supervisor`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Untuk menyamakan rasa setiap hidangan`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                                 `Make the flavor of every dish the same`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Untuk mencegah cemaran berpindah ke makanan yang tidak dimasak lagi`}:                                                                                                                                                                                   `Prevent contaminants from reaching food that will not be cooked again`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Agar alat lebih cepat habis dipakai`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                                   `Wear out the tools faster`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Supaya pekerja tidak perlu mencuci tangan`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                             `So workers do not need to wash their hands`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Hentikan penyajian salad, pisahkan alat dan bahan yang mungkin terkena, cuci tangan, lalu beri tahu pemimpin untuk penanganan ulang.`}:                                                                                                                  `Stop serving the salad, separate tools and ingredients that may have been contaminated, wash your hands, and tell the supervisor so they can be handled again.`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Pisahkan bahan mentah dari makanan siap makan`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                         `Separate raw ingredients from ready-to-eat food`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Cuci tangan setelah kontak dengan bahan mentah atau tugas kotor`}:                                                                                                                                                                                       `Wash hands after contact with raw ingredients or dirty tasks`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Bersihkan atau ganti alat sebelum berpindah tugas`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                     `Clean or replace tools before switching tasks`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Kenali label atau kode alat untuk tiap jenis bahan`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                    `Identify tool labels or codes for each ingredient type`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Menebak dari warna dan aroma makanan`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                                  `Guess based on the food's color and smell`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Menanyakan pelanggan yang memesan`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                                     `Ask the customer who ordered it`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Membaca label dan prosedur restoran yang berlaku`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                      `Read the label and applicable restaurant procedures`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Memakai angka yang sama untuk semua hidangan`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                          `Use the same value for all dishes`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Jangan sajikan sup. Tahan wadah, laporkan label dan alat yang bermasalah, lalu tunggu pemeriksaan sesuai prosedur.`}:                                                                                                                                    `Do not serve the soup. Hold the container, report the missing label and faulty tool, then wait for inspection according to procedure.`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Baca label waktu dan syarat penyimpanan`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                               `Read the time label and storage requirements`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Catat waktu dan suhu aktual`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                                           `Record the actual time and temperature`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Gunakan alat ukur sesuai instruksi`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                                    `Use the measuring tool as instructed`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Tahan bahan yang menyimpang dan laporkan`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                              `Hold ingredients outside the limits and report them`,
}

var englishSSWFoodServicePreparationCatalog = map[examSSWEnglishKey]string{
	{field: "ssw.group", source: `Persiapan hidangan dan permintaan alergi`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                                   `Dish Preparation and Allergy Requests`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Apa langkah yang benar saat bahan di stasiun tidak berlabel?`}:                                                                                                                                                                                              `What is the correct step when an ingredient at the station is unlabeled?`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Di tempat kerja, situasinya: Tiket memesan sup sayur, tetapi wadah di stasiun tidak berlabel dan isinya tidak dapat dikenali. Tindakan yang paling tepat adalah…`}:                                                                                          `Workplace scenario: The ticket orders vegetable soup, but a container at the station is unlabeled and its contents cannot be identified. The most appropriate action is to…`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Dalam alur «Persiapan bahan dan stasiun kerja», setelah langkah pertama selesai, apa tindakan berikutnya?`}:                                                                                                                                                 `In the workflow “Ingredient preparation and work station setup,” what should you do after completing the first step?`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Apa respons yang tepat bila informasi alergen di menu tidak lengkap?`}:                                                                                                                                                                                      `What is the appropriate response if allergen information on the menu is incomplete?`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Di tempat kerja, situasinya: Pelanggan bertanya apakah saus mengandung kacang, tetapi daftar bahan di stasiun belum diperbarui. Tindakan yang paling tepat adalah…`}:                                                                                        `Workplace scenario: A customer asks whether the sauce contains peanuts, but the ingredient list at the station has not been updated. The most appropriate action is to…`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Dalam alur «Menerima pertanyaan alergi pelanggan», setelah langkah pertama selesai, apa tindakan berikutnya?`}:                                                                                                                                              `In the workflow “Responding to a customer's allergy question,” what should you do after completing the first step?`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Apa cara memastikan perubahan pesanan sampai ke dapur dengan benar?`}:                                                                                                                                                                                       `How can you make sure an order change reaches the kitchen correctly?`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Di tempat kerja, situasinya: Pelanggan meminta hidangan tanpa telur karena alergi; tiket lama sudah masuk dapur tanpa catatan itu. Tindakan yang paling tepat adalah…`}:                                                                                     `Workplace scenario: A customer requests an egg-free dish because of an allergy; the original ticket has already gone to the kitchen without that note. The most appropriate action is to…`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Dalam alur «Perubahan pesanan dan pencegahan kontak silang», setelah langkah pertama selesai, apa tindakan berikutnya?`}:                                                                                                                                    `In the workflow “Order changes and cross-contact prevention,” what should you do after completing the first step?`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Identitas bahan harus pasti agar resep, keamanan, dan informasi alergi tetap benar.`}:                                                                                                                                                                  `Ingredient identity must be certain to ensure the recipe, safety, and allergy information are correct.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Bahan tanpa identitas tidak dipakai; pisahkan dan konfirmasi kepada pemimpin.`}:                                                                                                                                                                        `Do not use unidentified ingredients; set them aside and confirm with the supervisor.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Urutan yang diajarkan: Baca resep dan kebutuhan pesanan → Periksa bahan, label, dan alat yang diperlukan → Siapkan bahan dalam wadah terpisah dan beridentitas → Rapikan stasiun dan konfirmasi hal yang tidak jelas.`}:                                `The taught sequence is: Read the recipe and order requirements → Check the ingredients, labels, and required tools → Prepare ingredients in separate, identified containers → Organize the station and clarify anything uncertain.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Informasi yang belum terverifikasi tidak boleh disampaikan sebagai kepastian; eskalasikan ke pihak yang punya data.`}:                                                                                                                                  `Do not present unverified information as certain; escalate the question to someone with the correct data.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Daftar belum diperbarui, jadi hentikan tebakan dan verifikasi dengan penanggung jawab.`}:                                                                                                                                                               `The list has not been updated, so do not guess; verify the information with the person in charge.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Urutan yang diajarkan: Dengarkan permintaan dan catat bahan yang dihindari → Ulangi permintaan untuk memastikan maksud pelanggan → Periksa panduan dan konfirmasi dengan pihak berwenang → Sampaikan informasi yang terverifikasi atau pilihan aman.`}: `The taught sequence is: Listen to the request and note the ingredients to avoid → Repeat the request to confirm the customer's meaning → Check the guidance and confirm with an authorized person → Share verified information or a safe option.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Tiket yang benar dan konfirmasi menghubungkan permintaan dengan hidangan yang disiapkan.`}:                                                                                                                                                             `The correct ticket and confirmation connect the request to the dish being prepared.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Hidangan dibuat sebelum permintaan alergi dicatat; tahan dan buat alur pesanan yang benar.`}:                                                                                                                                                           `The dish was prepared before the allergy request was recorded; hold it and follow the correct order process.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Urutan yang diajarkan: Ulangi perubahan pesanan kepada pelanggan → Masukkan catatan pada tiket yang benar → Konfirmasi penerimaan perubahan oleh dapur → Periksa hidangan dan alat sebelum disajikan.`}:                                                `The taught sequence is: Repeat the order change to the customer → Add the note to the correct ticket → Confirm the kitchen received the change → Check the dish and tools before serving.`,
	{field: "ssw.passage", source: `Tiket memesan sup sayur, tetapi wadah di stasiun tidak berlabel dan isinya tidak dapat dikenali.`}:                                                                                                                                                         `The ticket orders vegetable soup, but a container at the station is unlabeled and its contents cannot be identified.`,
	{field: "ssw.passage", source: `Pelanggan bertanya apakah saus mengandung kacang, tetapi daftar bahan di stasiun belum diperbarui.`}:                                                                                                                                                       `A customer asks whether the sauce contains peanuts, but the ingredient list at the station has not been updated.`,
	{field: "ssw.passage", source: `Pelanggan meminta hidangan tanpa telur karena alergi; tiket lama sudah masuk dapur tanpa catatan itu.`}:                                                                                                                                                    `A customer requests an egg-free dish because of an allergy; the original ticket has already gone to the kitchen without that note.`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Cicipi sedikit untuk mengenali bahan`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                                      `Taste a little to identify the ingredient`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Gunakan hanya jika warnanya mirip resep`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                                   `Use it only if its color resembles the recipe`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Campur dengan bahan lain lalu tanyakan belakangan`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                         `Mix it with other ingredients and ask about it later`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Tahan bahan dan minta identifikasi sebelum dipakai`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                        `Set the ingredient aside and request identification before use`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Jangan gunakan isi wadah. Pisahkan dan minta identifikasi dari pemimpin sebelum menyiapkan pesanan.`}:                                                                                                                                                       `Do not use the container's contents. Set it aside and ask the supervisor to identify them before preparing the order.`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Periksa bahan, label, dan alat yang diperlukan`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                            `Check the ingredients, labels, and required tools`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Baca resep dan kebutuhan pesanan`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                                          `Read the recipe and order requirements`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Siapkan bahan dalam wadah terpisah dan beridentitas`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                       `Prepare ingredients in separate, identified containers`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Rapikan stasiun dan konfirmasi hal yang tidak jelas`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                       `Organize the station and clarify anything uncertain`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Jelaskan bahwa Anda akan memeriksa lalu konfirmasi kepada pemimpin`}:                                                                                                                                                                                        `Explain that you will check, then confirm with the supervisor`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Menjawab aman karena bahan tidak terlihat`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                                 `Say it is safe because the ingredient is not visible`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Meminta pelanggan mencoba sedikit`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                                         `Ask the customer to try a small amount`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Mengganti saus diam-diam tanpa memberi tahu`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                               `Change the sauce without telling anyone`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Jangan menebak. Katakan akan memeriksa, tahan rekomendasi hidangan, dan minta pemimpin memverifikasi informasi terbaru.`}:                                                                                                                                   `Do not guess. Say you will check, withhold a dish recommendation, and ask the supervisor to verify the latest information.`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Periksa panduan dan konfirmasi dengan pihak berwenang`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                     `Check the guidance and confirm with an authorized person`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Sampaikan informasi yang terverifikasi atau pilihan aman`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                  `Share verified information or a safe option`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Ulangi permintaan untuk memastikan maksud pelanggan`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                       `Repeat the request to confirm the customer's meaning`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Dengarkan permintaan dan catat bahan yang dihindari`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                       `Listen to the request and note the ingredients to avoid`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Biarkan dapur membaca pikiran pelanggan`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                                   `Let the kitchen read the customer's mind`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Catat pada tiket yang tepat dan konfirmasi dapur menerimanya`}:                                                                                                                                                                                              `Record it on the correct ticket and confirm the kitchen received it`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Sampaikan hanya kepada rekan tanpa memperbarui tiket`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                      `Tell a coworker without updating the ticket`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Ubah piring setelah masakan siap`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                                          `Change the plate after the dish is ready`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Jangan bawa hidangan lama. Hentikan penyajian, beri tahu dapur dan pemimpin, lalu buat tiket yang benar dan ikuti prosedur alergi.`}:                                                                                                                        `Do not serve the original dish. Stop service, inform the kitchen and supervisor, then create the correct ticket and follow the allergy procedure.`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Masukkan catatan pada tiket yang benar`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                                    `Add the note to the correct ticket`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Konfirmasi penerimaan perubahan oleh dapur`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                                `Confirm the kitchen received the change`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Periksa hidangan dan alat sebelum disajikan`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                               `Check the dish and tools before serving`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Ulangi perubahan pesanan kepada pelanggan`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                                 `Repeat the order change to the customer`,
}

var englishSSWFoodServiceHospitalityCatalog = map[examSSWEnglishKey]string{
	{field: "ssw.group", source: `Penerimaan tamu dan pelayanan meja`}:                                                                                                                                                                   `Guest Reception and Table Service`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Apa yang dilakukan sebelum mengantar tamu ke meja yang baru kosong?`}:                                                                                                                                 `What should be done before seating guests at a newly vacated table?`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Di tempat kerja, situasinya: Tamu datang tanpa reservasi, dan meja yang baru dikosongkan belum dibersihkan. Tindakan yang paling tepat adalah…`}:                                                      `Workplace scenario: Guests arrive without a reservation, and the newly vacated table has not been cleaned. The most appropriate action is to…`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Dalam alur «Menyambut tamu dan mengantar ke meja», setelah langkah pertama selesai, apa tindakan berikutnya?`}:                                                                                        `In the workflow “Greeting guests and seating them,” what should you do after completing the first step?`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Mengapa pekerja mengulang pesanan sebelum mengirim tiket?`}:                                                                                                                                           `Why does a worker repeat an order before sending the ticket?`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Di tempat kerja, situasinya: Pelanggan memesan dua hidangan dan menyebut satu tanpa bawang, tetapi pekerja hanya mencatat nama hidangannya. Tindakan yang paling tepat adalah…`}:                      `Workplace scenario: A customer orders two dishes and requests one without onions, but the worker records only the dish names. The most appropriate action is to…`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Dalam alur «Mencatat pesanan dan mengulang konfirmasi», setelah langkah pertama selesai, apa tindakan berikutnya?`}:                                                                                   `In the workflow “Recording orders and repeating them for confirmation,” what should you do after completing the first step?`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Apa yang diperiksa sebelum hidangan dibawa ke meja?`}:                                                                                                                                                 `What should be checked before carrying a dish to a table?`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Di tempat kerja, situasinya: Di lorong, pekerja mendapati tiket di nampan tertulis meja 8, tetapi rekan memanggilnya ke meja 6. Tindakan yang paling tepat adalah…`}:                                  `Workplace scenario: In the aisle, a worker sees that the ticket on a tray says table 8, but a coworker calls them to table 6. The most appropriate action is to…`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Dalam alur «Mengantar hidangan dan memeriksa meja», setelah langkah pertama selesai, apa tindakan berikutnya?`}:                                                                                       `In the workflow “Delivering dishes and checking the table,” what should you do after completing the first step?`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Meja perlu dipastikan siap dan jalurnya aman sebelum dipakai tamu.`}:                                                                                                                             `Confirm that the table is ready and the route is safe before seating guests.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Meja belum dibersihkan; beri informasi dan tunggu konfirmasi sebelum mengantar tamu.`}:                                                                                                           `The table has not been cleaned; explain this and wait for confirmation before seating the guests.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Urutan yang diajarkan: Sapa tamu dengan ungkapan yang sopan → Tanyakan reservasi atau jumlah orang bila perlu → Periksa meja dan jalur berjalan → Antar tamu dan sampaikan menu.`}:               `The taught sequence is: Greet the guests politely → Ask about a reservation or party size if needed → Check the table and walking route → Seat the guests and present the menu.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Pengulangan memberi kesempatan memperbaiki salah dengar sebelum dapur menyiapkan makanan.`}:                                                                                                      `Repeating the order gives you a chance to correct a misunderstanding before the kitchen prepares the food.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Permintaan belum tertulis; konfirmasi dan perbarui tiket sebelum dapur mulai.`}:                                                                                                                  `The request is not recorded; confirm it and update the ticket before the kitchen starts.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Urutan yang diajarkan: Dengarkan pesanan sampai selesai → Catat item dan jumlah pada meja yang benar → Ulangi pilihan utama untuk konfirmasi → Kirim tiket dan sampaikan permintaan khusus.`}:    `The taught sequence is: Listen to the complete order → Record the items and quantities at the correct table → Repeat the main choices for confirmation → Send the ticket and communicate special requests.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Pemeriksaan tiket mengurangi risiko salah hidangan dan salah meja.`}:                                                                                                                             `Checking the ticket reduces the risk of taking the wrong dish to the wrong table.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Ada dua nomor meja berbeda; berhenti dengan aman dan cocokkan tiket sebelum menyerahkan.`}:                                                                                                       `Two table numbers conflict; stop in a safe place and match the ticket before serving the dish.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Urutan yang diajarkan: Cocokkan hidangan dan jumlah dengan tiket → Periksa modifikasi serta kestabilan nampan → Bawa melalui jalur yang aman → Sebutkan hidangan dan pastikan meja yang benar.`}: `The taught sequence is: Match the dishes and quantities to the ticket → Check modifications and tray stability → Carry the dishes along a safe route → Name each dish and confirm the correct table.`,
	{field: "ssw.passage", source: `Tamu datang tanpa reservasi, dan meja yang baru dikosongkan belum dibersihkan.`}:                                                                                                                     `Guests arrive without a reservation, and the newly vacated table has not been cleaned.`,
	{field: "ssw.passage", source: `Pelanggan memesan dua hidangan dan menyebut satu tanpa bawang, tetapi pekerja hanya mencatat nama hidangannya.`}:                                                                                     `A customer orders two dishes and requests one without onions, but the worker records only the dish names.`,
	{field: "ssw.passage", source: `Di lorong, pekerja mendapati tiket di nampan tertulis meja 8, tetapi rekan memanggilnya ke meja 6.`}:                                                                                                 `In the aisle, a worker sees that the ticket on a tray says table 8, but a coworker calls them to table 6.`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Antar tamu lalu bersihkan saat mereka makan`}:                                                                                                                                                         `Seat the guests and clean the table while they eat`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Pindahkan peralatan dari meja sebelah tanpa izin`}:                                                                                                                                                    `Move equipment from a neighboring table without permission`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Pastikan meja telah dibersihkan dan siap dipakai`}:                                                                                                                                                    `Confirm that the table has been cleaned and is ready`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Minta tamu membersihkannya sendiri`}:                                                                                                                                                                  `Ask the guests to clean it themselves`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Sapa tamu, jelaskan bahwa meja sedang disiapkan, dan minta mereka menunggu di area yang ditentukan sampai meja dikonfirmasi siap.`}:                                                                   `Greet the guests, explain that the table is being prepared, and ask them to wait in the designated area until the table is confirmed ready.`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Sapa tamu dengan ungkapan yang sopan`}:                                                                                                                                                                `Greet the guests politely`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Periksa meja dan jalur berjalan`}:                                                                                                                                                                     `Check the table and walking route`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Tanyakan reservasi atau jumlah orang bila perlu`}:                                                                                                                                                     `Ask about a reservation or party size if needed`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Antar tamu dan sampaikan menu`}:                                                                                                                                                                       `Seat the guests and present the menu`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Agar tamu mengubah pesanannya`}:                                                                                                                                                                       `Make the guest change their order`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Untuk menunda pekerjaan dapur`}:                                                                                                                                                                       `Delay the kitchen's work`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Supaya tiket tidak perlu dibaca`}:                                                                                                                                                                     `So the ticket does not need to be read`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Untuk memastikan item, jumlah, dan permintaan khusus benar`}:                                                                                                                                          `Confirm that the items, quantities, and special requests are correct`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Konfirmasi kembali permintaan tanpa bawang, perbarui tiket meja yang benar, lalu pastikan dapur menerima catatan itu.`}:                                                                               `Confirm the request for no onions, update the correct table's ticket, and make sure the kitchen receives the note.`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Catat item dan jumlah pada meja yang benar`}:                                                                                                                                                          `Record the items and quantities at the correct table`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Dengarkan pesanan sampai selesai`}:                                                                                                                                                                    `Listen to the complete order`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Ulangi pilihan utama untuk konfirmasi`}:                                                                                                                                                               `Repeat the main choices for confirmation`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Kirim tiket dan sampaikan permintaan khusus`}:                                                                                                                                                         `Send the ticket and communicate special requests`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Nama hidangan, jumlah, modifikasi, dan nomor meja`}:                                                                                                                                                   `Dish name, quantity, modifications, and table number`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Warna seragam pelanggan`}:                                                                                                                                                                             `The customer's uniform color`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Meja yang paling dekat dengan dapur`}:                                                                                                                                                                 `The table closest to the kitchen`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Jumlah nampan yang tersedia saja`}:                                                                                                                                                                    `Only the number of available trays`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Berhenti di tempat aman dan cocokkan tiket dengan nomor meja; jangan menyerahkan hidangan sampai tujuan dipastikan.`}:                                                                                 `Stop in a safe place and match the ticket to the table number; do not serve the dish until its destination is confirmed.`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Bawa melalui jalur yang aman`}:                                                                                                                                                                        `Carry the dishes along a safe route`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Sebutkan hidangan dan pastikan meja yang benar`}:                                                                                                                                                      `Name each dish and confirm the correct table`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Periksa modifikasi serta kestabilan nampan`}:                                                                                                                                                          `Check modifications and tray stability`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Cocokkan hidangan dan jumlah dengan tiket`}:                                                                                                                                                           `Match the dishes and quantities to the ticket`,
}

var englishSSWFoodServiceClosingCatalog = map[examSSWEnglishKey]string{
	{field: "ssw.group", source: `Tanggapan masalah, pembayaran, dan penutupan`}:          `Handling Issues, Payment, and Closing`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Bagaimana cara awal yang baik saat menerima keluhan?`}: `What is a good first response to a complaint?`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Di tempat kerja, situasinya: Pelanggan mengatakan setelah mencicipi hidangan, ia merasa tidak sehat dan ingin tahu siapa yang bertanggung jawab. Tindakan yang paling tepat adalah…`}:                                             `Workplace scenario: A customer says they felt ill after tasting a dish and wants to know who is responsible. The most appropriate action is to…`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Dalam alur «Menangani keluhan pelanggan», setelah langkah pertama selesai, apa tindakan berikutnya?`}:                                                                                                                             `In the workflow “Handling a customer complaint,” what should you do after completing the first step?`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Apa yang dilakukan saat terminal belum menunjukkan status pembayaran yang jelas?`}:                                                                                                                                                `What should you do when the terminal has not shown a clear payment status?`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Di tempat kerja, situasinya: Terminal pembayaran menampilkan pesan menunggu setelah kartu pelanggan disentuhkan, dan pelanggan meminta pekerja mencoba lagi. Tindakan yang paling tepat adalah…`}:                                 `Workplace scenario: The payment terminal shows a pending message after the customer's card is tapped, and the customer asks the worker to try again. The most appropriate action is to…`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Dalam alur «Pembayaran dan pemeriksaan tagihan», setelah langkah pertama selesai, apa tindakan berikutnya?`}:                                                                                                                      `In the workflow “Payment and bill check,” what should you do after completing the first step?`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Apa yang disampaikan saat serah terima akhir giliran?`}:                                                                                                                                                                           `What should be communicated in an end-of-shift handover?`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Di tempat kerja, situasinya: Pada akhir giliran, wadah bahan terbuka belum diberi label waktu dan pembersihan lemari pendingin belum dicatat. Tindakan yang paling tepat adalah…`}:                                                `Workplace scenario: At the end of a shift, an open ingredient container has no time label and cleaning of the refrigerator has not been recorded. The most appropriate action is to…`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Dalam alur «Pembersihan, pengisian ulang, dan serah terima», setelah langkah pertama selesai, apa tindakan berikutnya?`}:                                                                                                          `In the workflow “Cleaning, restocking, and handover,” what should you do after completing the first step?`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Mendengarkan dan memeriksa fakta membantu menentukan tindak lanjut yang tepat.`}:                                                                                                                                             `Listening and checking the facts help determine the proper follow-up.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Kemungkinan masalah kesehatan harus dieskalasikan; jangan berdebat atau berspekulasi.`}:                                                                                                                                      `A possible health issue must be escalated; do not argue or speculate.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Urutan yang diajarkan: Dengarkan pelanggan tanpa menyela → Ulangi inti masalah dan minta maaf dengan sopan → Hubungi pemimpin untuk keputusan sesuai wewenang → Catat fakta dan tindak lanjut yang diperlukan.`}:             `The taught sequence is: Listen to the customer without interrupting → Repeat the main concern and apologize politely → Contact the supervisor for a decision within their authority → Record the facts and needed follow-up.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Memeriksa transaksi mencegah pembayaran ganda dan menjaga data pelanggan.`}:                                                                                                                                                  `Checking the transaction prevents duplicate payment and protects customer data.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Status pembayaran belum jelas; cek sistem atau panggil pemimpin sebelum mengulang.`}:                                                                                                                                         `The payment status is unclear; check the system or ask the supervisor before trying again.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Urutan yang diajarkan: Cocokkan meja dan item pada tagihan → Sampaikan jumlah pembayaran dengan jelas → Proses metode pembayaran sesuai sistem → Konfirmasi hasil transaksi dan serahkan bukti.`}:                            `The taught sequence is: Match the table and items on the bill → State the payment amount clearly → Process payment according to the system → Confirm the transaction and provide the receipt.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Status yang jelas membantu giliran berikutnya mengelola bahan dan menuntaskan tugas.`}:                                                                                                                                       `Clear status information helps the next shift manage ingredients and finish open tasks.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Wadah dan pembersihan belum memiliki catatan lengkap; laporkan dan serahkan statusnya.`}:                                                                                                                                     `The container and cleaning do not have complete records; report and hand over their status.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Urutan yang diajarkan: Periksa daftar tugas penutupan → Bersihkan dan simpan alat sesuai aturan area → Tandai bahan, stok, atau pekerjaan yang masih terbuka → Serahkan informasi kepada pemimpin atau giliran berikutnya.`}: `The taught sequence is: Check the closing task list → Clean and store equipment according to area rules → Mark ingredients, stock, or work still open → Hand over the information to the supervisor or next shift.`,
	{field: "ssw.passage", source: `Pelanggan mengatakan setelah mencicipi hidangan, ia merasa tidak sehat dan ingin tahu siapa yang bertanggung jawab.`}:                                                                                                            `A customer says they felt ill after tasting a dish and wants to know who is responsible.`,
	{field: "ssw.passage", source: `Terminal pembayaran menampilkan pesan menunggu setelah kartu pelanggan disentuhkan, dan pelanggan meminta pekerja mencoba lagi.`}:                                                                                                `The payment terminal shows a pending message after the customer's card is tapped, and the customer asks the worker to try again.`,
	{field: "ssw.passage", source: `Pada akhir giliran, wadah bahan terbuka belum diberi label waktu dan pembersihan lemari pendingin belum dicatat.`}:                                                                                                               `At the end of a shift, an open ingredient container has no time label and cleaning of the refrigerator has not been recorded.`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Mengabaikan keluhan sampai pelanggan pergi`}:                                                                                                                                                                                      `Ignore the complaint until the customer leaves`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Dengarkan, ulangi masalah, dan beri tahu bahwa Anda akan memeriksa`}:                                                                                                                                                              `Listen, repeat the concern, and say that you will check it`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Menyalahkan pelanggan karena salah memilih`}:                                                                                                                                                                                      `Blame the customer for choosing incorrectly`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Menjanjikan pengembalian uang sebelum bertanya`}:                                                                                                                                                                                  `Promise a refund before asking any questions`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Tanggapi dengan tenang, hentikan penyajian hidangan terkait, panggil pemimpin, dan catat waktu serta hidangan tanpa berspekulasi.`}:                                                                                               `Respond calmly, stop serving the dish in question, call the supervisor, and record the time and dish without speculating.`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Ulangi inti masalah dan minta maaf dengan sopan`}:                                                                                                                                                                                 `Repeat the main concern and apologize politely`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Hubungi pemimpin untuk keputusan sesuai wewenang`}:                                                                                                                                                                                `Contact the supervisor for a decision within their authority`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Catat fakta dan tindak lanjut yang diperlukan`}:                                                                                                                                                                                   `Record the facts and needed follow-up`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Dengarkan pelanggan tanpa menyela`}:                                                                                                                                                                                               `Listen to the customer without interrupting`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Ulangi transaksi beberapa kali dengan cepat`}:                                                                                                                                                                                     `Repeat the transaction several times quickly`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Simpan data kartu pelanggan untuk nanti`}:                                                                                                                                                                                         `Save the customer's card data for later`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Periksa status transaksi sebelum mencoba lagi`}:                                                                                                                                                                                   `Check the transaction status before trying again`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Minta pelanggan membayar tunai tanpa cek`}:                                                                                                                                                                                        `Ask the customer to pay cash without checking`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Periksa status transaksi pada sistem atau minta bantuan pemimpin sebelum mengulang, agar pelanggan tidak tertagih dua kali.`}:                                                                                                     `Check the transaction status in the system or ask the supervisor for help before retrying, so the customer is not charged twice.`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Cocokkan meja dan item pada tagihan`}:                                                                                                                                                                                             `Match the table and items on the bill`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Proses metode pembayaran sesuai sistem`}:                                                                                                                                                                                          `Process payment according to the system`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Sampaikan jumlah pembayaran dengan jelas`}:                                                                                                                                                                                        `State the payment amount clearly`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Konfirmasi hasil transaksi dan serahkan bukti`}:                                                                                                                                                                                   `Confirm the transaction and provide the receipt`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Hanya jumlah pelanggan yang datang`}:                                                                                                                                                                                              `Only the number of customers who came in`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Dugaan tanpa lokasi atau status`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                 `A guess without a location or status`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Bahwa semua selesai walau belum dicatat`}:                                                                                                                                                                                         `That everything is finished, even if it has not been recorded`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Stok rendah, alat rusak, bahan ditahan, dan tugas terbuka`}:                                                                                                                                                                       `Low stock, damaged equipment, ingredients on hold, and open tasks`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Pisahkan wadah untuk penilaian sesuai aturan, catat pembersihan yang belum selesai, dan serahkan kedua hal itu kepada pemimpin.`}:                                                                                                 `Set the container aside for assessment according to rules, record the unfinished cleaning, and hand over both issues to the supervisor.`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Bersihkan dan simpan alat sesuai aturan area`}:                                                                                                                                                                                    `Clean and store equipment according to area rules`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Periksa daftar tugas penutupan`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                  `Check the closing task list`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Tandai bahan, stok, atau pekerjaan yang masih terbuka`}:                                                                                                                                                                           `Mark ingredients, stock, or work still open`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Serahkan informasi kepada pemimpin atau giliran berikutnya`}:                                                                                                                                                                      `Hand over the information to the supervisor or next shift`,
}

var englishSSWForestrySiteCatalog = map[examSSWEnglishKey]string{
	{field: "ssw.group", source: `Persiapan lokasi dan keselamatan lapangan`}:                                                                                                                                                                                             `Site Preparation and Field Safety`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Apa yang perlu dipastikan sebelum kru masuk ke lokasi hutan?`}:                                                                                                                                                                         `What must be confirmed before a crew enters a forest worksite?`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Di tempat kerja, situasinya: Pekerja menerima peta dengan titik kerja baru, tetapi radio tidak dapat tersambung dengan pemimpin. Tindakan yang paling tepat adalah…`}:                                                                  `Workplace scenario: A worker receives a map with a new work point, but the radio cannot connect to the supervisor. The most appropriate action is to…`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Dalam alur «Rencana kerja, lokasi, dan komunikasi darurat», setelah langkah pertama selesai, apa tindakan berikutnya?`}:                                                                                                                `In the workflow “Work plan, location, and emergency communication,” what should you do after completing the first step?`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Apa yang harus dilakukan saat kondisi medan berubah setelah hujan?`}:                                                                                                                                                                   `What should you do when terrain conditions change after rain?`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Di tempat kerja, situasinya: Setelah hujan, jalur ke titik kerja memiliki tanah yang ambles dan satu cabang besar menggantung di atas lintasan. Tindakan yang paling tepat adalah…`}:                                                   `Workplace scenario: After rain, the route to the work point has a ground collapse and a large branch hanging over the path. The most appropriate action is to…`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Dalam alur «Membaca medan dan mengenali bahaya», setelah langkah pertama selesai, apa tindakan berikutnya?`}:                                                                                                                           `In the workflow “Reading terrain and recognizing hazards,” what should you do after completing the first step?`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Apa yang dilakukan jika perlengkapan pelindung rusak sebelum kerja?`}:                                                                                                                                                                  `What should you do if protective equipment is damaged before work?`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Di tempat kerja, situasinya: Rekan meminta pekerja baru menggunakan gergaji mesin, tetapi ia belum mengikuti pelatihan yang diwajibkan. Tindakan yang paling tepat adalah…`}:                                                           `Workplace scenario: A coworker asks a new worker to use a chainsaw, but they have not completed the required training. The most appropriate action is to…`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Dalam alur «Perlengkapan pelindung dan batas tugas», setelah langkah pertama selesai, apa tindakan berikutnya?`}:                                                                                                                       `In the workflow “Protective equipment and task limits,” what should you do after completing the first step?`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Lokasi dan komunikasi yang dipahami bersama membantu kru bekerja dan meminta bantuan dengan cepat.`}:                                                                                                                              `When everyone understands the location and communications plan, the crew can work and request help quickly.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Gangguan komunikasi membuat kontak tidak pasti; jangan masuk sebelum pemimpin menentukan tindakan.`}:                                                                                                                              `The communication failure makes contact uncertain; do not enter until the supervisor decides what to do.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Urutan yang diajarkan: Baca atau dengarkan rencana kerja hari ini → Pastikan lokasi, tugas, dan rute masuk-keluar → Periksa alat komunikasi dan kontak darurat → Ulangi instruksi yang belum dipahami sebelum berangkat.`}:        `The taught sequence is: Read or listen to today's work plan → Confirm the location, task, and entry and exit routes → Check communication equipment and emergency contacts → Repeat any unclear instructions before departure.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Kondisi tanah dan cabang dapat berubah; kru menilai ulang dan memakai jalur yang disetujui.`}:                                                                                                                                     `Ground and branch conditions can change; reassess the hazards and use an approved route.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Jalur ambles dan cabang menggantung harus dihindari dan dilaporkan sebelum pekerjaan lanjut.`}:                                                                                                                                    `Avoid the collapsed path and hanging branch, and report them before work continues.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Urutan yang diajarkan: Amati medan dan cuaca dari titik aman → Kenali bahaya di atas, bawah, dan sepanjang jalur → Tandai atau laporkan bahaya kepada kru → Gunakan jalur yang disetujui dan tinjau ulang bila kondisi berubah.`}: `The taught sequence is: Observe terrain and weather from a safe point → Identify hazards above, below, and along the route → Mark or report hazards to the crew → Use an approved route and reassess if conditions change.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Perlengkapan rusak dapat gagal melindungi; kondisi harus dilaporkan dan diperbaiki sebelum tugas.`}:                                                                                                                               `Damaged equipment may fail to protect you; report and replace it before starting the task.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Pekerja belum terlatih untuk tugas tersebut; jangan mengoperasikan gergaji dan minta pemimpin mengatur tugas.`}:                                                                                                                   `The worker has not been trained for this task; do not operate the chainsaw and ask the supervisor to assign the work appropriately.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Urutan yang diajarkan: Baca jenis tugas dan perlengkapan yang diwajibkan → Periksa kondisi serta kecocokan perlengkapan → Laporkan kerusakan dan ganti sebelum bekerja → Pastikan tugas sesuai pelatihan dan arahan.`}:            `The taught sequence is: Read the task type and required protective equipment → Check the equipment's condition and fit → Report damage and replace it before work → Confirm the task is within your training and instructions.`,
	{field: "ssw.passage", source: `Pekerja menerima peta dengan titik kerja baru, tetapi radio tidak dapat tersambung dengan pemimpin.`}:                                                                                                                                 `A worker receives a map with a new work point, but the radio cannot connect to the supervisor.`,
	{field: "ssw.passage", source: `Setelah hujan, jalur ke titik kerja memiliki tanah yang ambles dan satu cabang besar menggantung di atas lintasan.`}:                                                                                                                  `After rain, the route to the work point has a ground collapse and a large branch hanging over the path.`,
	{field: "ssw.passage", source: `Rekan meminta pekerja baru menggunakan gergaji mesin, tetapi ia belum mengikuti pelatihan yang diwajibkan.`}:                                                                                                                          `A coworker asks a new worker to use a chainsaw, but they have not completed the required training.`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Lokasi, tugas, rute, dan cara menghubungi bantuan`}:                                                                                                                                                                                    `The location, task, route, and how to contact assistance`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Hanya jumlah alat yang dibawa`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                        `Only the number of tools being carried`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Lokasi kendaraan pribadi pekerja`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                     `Where the worker parked their personal vehicle`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Perkiraan hasil kayu hari ini`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                        `An estimate of today's timber output`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Masuk ke area berbahaya sebelum ada tanda aman`}:                                                                                                                                                                                       `Enter a hazardous area before receiving an all-clear`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Menebak instruksi atau mengganti prosedur sendiri`}:                                                                                                                                                                                    `Guess the instructions or change the procedure on your own`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Meneruskan pekerjaan walau alat atau komunikasi bermasalah`}:                                                                                                                                                                           `Continue working despite equipment or communication problems`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Jangan masuk ke lokasi. Periksa alat sesuai instruksi dan laporkan gangguan komunikasi agar jalur kontak dipastikan.`}:                                                                                                                 `Do not enter the site. Check the equipment as instructed and report the communication problem so a reliable contact method can be confirmed.`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Ulangi instruksi yang belum dipahami sebelum berangkat`}:                                                                                                                                                                               `Repeat any unclear instructions before departure`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Pastikan lokasi, tugas, dan rute masuk-keluar`}:                                                                                                                                                                                        `Confirm the location, task, and entry and exit routes`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Baca atau dengarkan rencana kerja hari ini`}:                                                                                                                                                                                           `Read or listen to today's work plan`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Periksa alat komunikasi dan kontak darurat`}:                                                                                                                                                                                           `Check communication equipment and emergency contacts`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Minta pekerja lain berjalan di bawah cabang dahulu`}:                                                                                                                                                                                   `Ask another worker to walk beneath the branch first`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Nilai ulang bahaya dan laporkan sebelum melewati jalur`}:                                                                                                                                                                               `Reassess the hazards and report them before using the route`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Tetap lewat karena jalur kemarin aman`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                `Use the route anyway because it was safe yesterday`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Lari cepat agar tidak lama di lereng`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                 `Run quickly to avoid staying on the slope`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Jangan melewati titik itu. Beri tanda atau jarak aman sesuai aturan kru dan laporkan agar pemimpin memilih jalur atau tindakan aman.`}:                                                                                                 `Do not pass that point. Mark it or keep a safe distance according to crew rules, and report it so the supervisor can choose a safe route or action.`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Amati medan dan cuaca dari titik aman`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                `Observe terrain and weather from a safe point`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Tandai atau laporkan bahaya kepada kru`}:                                                                                                                                                                                               `Mark or report hazards to the crew`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Gunakan jalur yang disetujui dan tinjau ulang bila kondisi berubah`}:                                                                                                                                                                   `Use an approved route and reassess if conditions change`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Kenali bahaya di atas, bawah, dan sepanjang jalur`}:                                                                                                                                                                                    `Identify hazards above, below, and along the route`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Tutup retakan dengan kain lalu lanjut`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                `Cover the crack with cloth and continue`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Pinjam alat orang lain tanpa memberi tahu`}:                                                                                                                                                                                            `Borrow someone else's equipment without telling them`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Hentikan persiapan dan minta penggantian sebelum mulai`}:                                                                                                                                                                               `Stop preparation and request a replacement before starting`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Pakai saja selama kerusakan kecil`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                    `Use it as long as the damage is minor`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Tolak dengan sopan, jangan menyalakan gergaji, dan beri tahu pemimpin agar pekerjaan diberikan kepada orang yang berwenang.`}:                                                                                                          `Politely decline, do not start the chainsaw, and tell the supervisor so the task can be assigned to an authorized person.`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Baca jenis tugas dan perlengkapan yang diwajibkan`}:                                                                                                                                                                                    `Read the task type and required protective equipment`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Periksa kondisi serta kecocokan perlengkapan`}:                                                                                                                                                                                         `Check the equipment's condition and fit`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Laporkan kerusakan dan ganti sebelum bekerja`}:                                                                                                                                                                                         `Report damage and replace the equipment before work`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Pastikan tugas sesuai pelatihan dan arahan`}:                                                                                                                                                                                           `Confirm the task is within your training and instructions`,
}

var englishSSWForestrySilvicultureCatalog = map[examSSWEnglishKey]string{
	{field: "ssw.group", source: `Penanaman dan pemeliharaan hutan`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                        `Forest Planting and Maintenance`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Mengapa batas petak dan jalur kerja diperiksa sebelum persiapan lahan?`}:                                                                                                                                                                 `Why check plot boundaries and work routes before preparing the land?`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Di tempat kerja, situasinya: Tanda batas petak tidak terlihat di satu sisi dan jalur kerja mengarah ke dekat aliran air. Tindakan yang paling tepat adalah…`}:                                                                            `Workplace scenario: A plot boundary marker is not visible on one side, and the work route leads close to a waterway. The most appropriate action is to…`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Dalam alur «Persiapan petak tanam dan perlindungan tanah», setelah langkah pertama selesai, apa tindakan berikutnya?`}:                                                                                                                   `In the workflow “Preparing a planting plot and protecting soil,” what should you do after completing the first step?`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Apa yang harus diperiksa sebelum menanam bibit?`}:                                                                                                                                                                                        `What should be checked before planting seedlings?`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Di tempat kerja, situasinya: Di satu bundel terdapat bibit dengan label jenis berbeda dari petak yang sedang ditanami. Tindakan yang paling tepat adalah…`}:                                                                              `Workplace scenario: One bundle contains seedlings labeled as a different species from the plot being planted. The most appropriate action is to…`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Dalam alur «Pemilihan bibit dan penanaman», setelah langkah pertama selesai, apa tindakan berikutnya?`}:                                                                                                                                  `In the workflow “Seedling selection and planting,” what should you do after completing the first step?`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Apa yang dilakukan saat tanda tanaman sasaran tidak terlihat jelas?`}:                                                                                                                                                                    `What should you do when the target-tree marker is unclear?`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Di tempat kerja, situasinya: Tanda tanaman sasaran tertutup semak, sementara seorang rekan bergerak di sisi lereng yang sama. Tindakan yang paling tepat adalah…`}:                                                                       `Workplace scenario: The target-tree marker is covered by brush while a coworker is moving on the same side of the slope. The most appropriate action is to…`,
	{field: "ssw.prompt", source: `Dalam alur «Pemeliharaan vegetasi dan keselamatan rekan», setelah langkah pertama selesai, apa tindakan berikutnya?`}:                                                                                                                    `In the workflow “Vegetation maintenance and coworker safety,” what should you do after completing the first step?`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Peta dan tanda menjaga pekerjaan dalam batas yang ditetapkan serta melindungi area sensitif.`}:                                                                                                                                      `Maps and markers keep work within designated boundaries and protect sensitive areas.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Batas dan jalur dekat air belum pasti; hentikan dan minta konfirmasi sebelum masuk.`}:                                                                                                                                               `The boundary and route near the water are uncertain; stop and request confirmation before entering.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Urutan yang diajarkan: Cocokkan peta dan tanda batas petak → Pastikan jalur dan area yang harus dilindungi → Siapkan alat pada tempat yang aman → Laporkan batas atau tanda yang tidak jelas.`}:                                     `The taught sequence is: Match the map to plot-boundary markers → Confirm the route and protected areas → Prepare tools in a safe place → Report unclear boundaries or markers.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Pencocokan jenis dan kondisi mencegah bibit salah masuk ke petak.`}:                                                                                                                                                                 `Checking the species and condition prevents the wrong seedlings from being planted in a plot.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Label jenis berbeda dari rencana; tahan bundel dan minta konfirmasi.`}:                                                                                                                                                              `The species label differs from the plan; hold the bundle and request confirmation.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Urutan yang diajarkan: Cocokkan jenis dan jumlah bibit dengan catatan → Periksa kondisi bibit sebelum dibawa → Tanam pada titik dan jarak yang ditunjukkan → Catat bibit rusak atau titik yang tidak dapat ditanami.`}:              `The taught sequence is: Match the seedling species and quantity to the records → Check seedling condition before carrying them → Plant at the marked points and spacing → Record damaged seedlings or locations that cannot be planted.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Tanaman yang harus dipertahankan dapat rusak bila sasaran ditebak; konfirmasi dulu.`}:                                                                                                                                               `Trees meant to be preserved could be damaged if the target is guessed; confirm it first.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Alat harus berhenti sampai posisi rekan dan sasaran pemeliharaan dipastikan aman.`}:                                                                                                                                                 `Stop the equipment until the coworker's position and the maintenance target are confirmed safe.`,
	{field: "ssw.explanation", source: `Urutan yang diajarkan: Baca tanda tanaman dan sasaran pemeliharaan → Pastikan jarak aman serta komunikasi dengan rekan → Kerjakan hanya vegetasi yang ditetapkan → Hentikan alat dan laporkan bila tanda atau posisi tidak jelas.`}: `The taught sequence is: Read tree markers and maintenance targets → Confirm safe distance and communication with coworkers → Work only on designated vegetation → Stop equipment and report unclear markers or positions.`,
	{field: "ssw.passage", source: `Tanda batas petak tidak terlihat di satu sisi dan jalur kerja mengarah ke dekat aliran air.`}:                                                                                                                                           `A plot boundary marker is not visible on one side, and the work route leads close to a waterway.`,
	{field: "ssw.passage", source: `Di satu bundel terdapat bibit dengan label jenis berbeda dari petak yang sedang ditanami.`}:                                                                                                                                             `One bundle contains seedlings labeled as a different species from the plot being planted.`,
	{field: "ssw.passage", source: `Tanda tanaman sasaran tertutup semak, sementara seorang rekan bergerak di sisi lereng yang sama.`}:                                                                                                                                      `The target-tree marker is covered by brush while a coworker is moving on the same side of the slope.`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Agar pekerja dapat mengabaikan tanda lama`}:                                                                                                                                                                                              `So workers can ignore old markers`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Untuk menghindari pencatatan petak`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                     `To avoid recording plots`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Supaya seluruh vegetasi dibersihkan`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                    `So all vegetation is cleared`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Agar pekerjaan tetap pada area rencana dan mengurangi kerusakan tanah atau air`}:                                                                                                                                                         `Keep work within the planned area and reduce damage to soil or water`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Berhenti sebelum batas yang diragukan, hindari memasuki area dekat aliran, dan minta pemimpin mengonfirmasi peta serta tanda.`}:                                                                                                          `Stop before the uncertain boundary, avoid the area near the waterway, and ask the supervisor to confirm the map and markers.`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Laporkan batas atau tanda yang tidak jelas`}:                                                                                                                                                                                             `Report unclear boundaries or markers`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Cocokkan peta dan tanda batas petak`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                    `Match the map to plot-boundary markers`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Siapkan alat pada tempat yang aman`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                     `Prepare tools in a safe place`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Pastikan jalur dan area yang harus dilindungi`}:                                                                                                                                                                                          `Confirm the route and protected areas`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Jenis, jumlah, kondisi, dan tanda titik tanam`}:                                                                                                                                                                                          `Species, quantity, condition, and planting-point markers`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Warna daun saja`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                                        `Leaf color alone`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Jarak dari jalan raya saja`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                             `Distance from the main road alone`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Bundel mana yang paling dekat`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                          `Which bundle is closest`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Pisahkan bundel itu, jangan tanam, dan minta pemimpin memastikan jenis bibit sebelum pekerjaan dilanjutkan.`}:                                                                                                                            `Set the bundle aside, do not plant it, and ask the supervisor to confirm the seedling species before work continues.`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Catat bibit rusak atau titik yang tidak dapat ditanami`}:                                                                                                                                                                                 `Record damaged seedlings or locations that cannot be planted`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Periksa kondisi bibit sebelum dibawa`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                   `Check seedling condition before carrying them`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Cocokkan jenis dan jumlah bibit dengan catatan`}:                                                                                                                                                                                         `Match the seedling species and quantity to the records`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Tanam pada titik dan jarak yang ditunjukkan`}:                                                                                                                                                                                            `Plant at the marked points and spacing`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Lanjutkan lebih cepat sebelum tanda hilang`}:                                                                                                                                                                                             `Work faster before the marker disappears`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Hentikan pekerjaan dan konfirmasi sasaran sebelum memakai alat`}:                                                                                                                                                                         `Stop work and confirm the target before using equipment`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Bersihkan semua tanaman di sekitar`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                     `Clear all nearby plants`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Ikuti dugaan rekan tanpa memeriksa`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                     `Follow a coworker's guess without checking`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Hentikan alat, panggil rekan dan pemimpin, lalu pastikan batas sasaran serta jarak aman sebelum bekerja lagi.`}:                                                                                                                          `Stop the equipment, call the coworker and supervisor, and confirm the target boundary and safe distance before resuming work.`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Baca tanda tanaman dan sasaran pemeliharaan`}:                                                                                                                                                                                            `Read tree markers and maintenance targets`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Kerjakan hanya vegetasi yang ditetapkan`}:                                                                                                                                                                                                `Work only on designated vegetation`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Hentikan alat dan laporkan bila tanda atau posisi tidak jelas`}:                                                                                                                                                                          `Stop equipment and report unclear markers or positions`,
	{field: "ssw.option", source: `Pastikan jarak aman serta komunikasi dengan rekan`}:                                                                                                                                                                                      `Confirm safe distance and communication with coworkers`,
}

